<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version .</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka ya chitabu chimwe mne pfitabu pfine ipfili mne Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli inoghile). Tsapfandikighwa na Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Luka ng'andike bae mbuli tsa Yesu tsiliheka, ila pfipfila kandika mne chitabu cha Ghamatendo ghe iwatumighwa pfinu pfawatendile wanang'ina wa Yesu hambele he ukufa na ukutsilihuka kwa Yesu. Haduhu imunu iyomanya ghendo Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka yandikighwe tsuwachi au kwani, ila iwasomi wengi wotoghola ka yandikighwa kune miyaka ya sabini kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyandike tsakakala Luka, iyakalile bwana mghanga. Pfandike na ilugha yaitumile kolangusa ka yeye tsakakala msomi. Luka tsakabama yandike pfinoghile ghendo mbuli tsa Yesu, tsakandika ipfinu ka pfapfilawile, ili wanu wangi hawosoma wadahe kumanya ghoya mbuli tsa Yesu. (Luka 1:1-3) Yeye tsa si Myahudi bae (Kolo 4:10-14) apfo kandika kwa nzila iitenda iwanu iwali si wayahudi wadahe kupfimanya ghoya. Chinu chino chakoneka mwatsi hala halongile pfihendo pfa Wayahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile yandikighwe na Luka yeghala ghendo na pfitabu pfa Matei na Maliki, kwaapfila pfolonga pfinu pfimwe na kwa nzila iighala. Mna pfitabu pfino pfidatu, Luka kandika mbuli nyingi tsa ukwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa. Pfipfila Luka kokomangitsa ukuleghusighwa nzambi. (isula ya 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na ghamaombi (isula ya 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-4, Luka koitambulisha Imbuli Inoghile na kolonga ule kayandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:5-4-13, kolonga ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu na pfayandae kwa isang'ano yake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 4:14-21-38, kolonga ng'onde tsatendile Yesu, ghendoghendo pfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfatendile na pfinu pfalangulitse.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 22-24, komalitsila kwa ukulonga mbuli tsa ukufa kwa Yesu, pfatsikighwe, na pfatsilihuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Imkulu Teofili,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Iwanu wengi tsawandusa ukwandika pfawadahile tsimbuli tse ipfinu ipfitendeke mghati mwetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Tsawandika ipfinu pfatulongelighwe ne iwanu iwonile ipfinu pfino kulawa mwanduso, ne iwanu wawala iwalongile tsimbuli tsinoghile. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Aghweye Imkulu, kwaapfila imwenyegho nipfibama ipfinu pfino pfose kulawa mwanduso, tsambona pfinogha ukukwandikila ghoya ipfinu pfilawile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Notenda pfino naghwe umanye ukweli wose we ipfinu pfaulangusilighwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa kwolangusighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mna matsuwa ghala Herodi hayakalile imndewa wa Yudeya, tsakukala na mlapfa nambiko yumwe yakemighwe Sakariya, kolawila mna walapfa nambiko wa Abiya. Mwehe wake kakemighwa Elisabeti naye kolawa mne lukolo lwe Aruni, mlapfa nambiko. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Wose weli wakala wanogha kwe Imulungu, aku wakinda ghendo ghamalaghitso ghose ghe Imtwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Wose tsawahela iwana kwaapfila Elisabeti yang'ali ng'akweleka bae, na wose tsawalala ghendo.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Litsuwa limwe Zakariya kakala mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu kotenda isang'ano yake ya kutambika, tsaikala nzamu yake. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Zakariya tsakasaghulighwa kwa kwasa simbi, ka watambika pfawang'ali wotendagha. Apfo kengila mng'anda mwe IMNDEWA akadusule ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Ne ichipindi che kupfukitsa ubani pfachitsile, iwanu wose wakala wolomba kunze.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kuya malaika we IMNDEWA, kamlawila, kema ubali wa kujilo wa hanu hala kupfukitsila ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakariya hamwonile, keduka kuya kapfuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Imalaika kamlongela, “Uleke kupfuka, Sakariya! Imulungu kahulika chaumlombile. Mwehe wako katsokwelekela imwana immale naghwe kutsomkema Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kutsosekelela ng'ani na kudeng'elela, ne iwanu wengi watsodeng'elela kwa ukwelekighwa kwake! <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Katsakuwa imunu imkulu hambele he IMNDEWA. Ng'atsakunwa bae idipfai wala mbwali. Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu katsommemetsa kulawa litsuwa lya ukwelekighwa kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Katsowoyitsa iwanu wengi we Isiraeli woye kwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wawo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Katsolongola hambele he IMNDEWA, katsakuwa ne ingupfu na ghumuhe ka nabii Eliya. Tsina aba watsowanoghela keli iwana wao, katsowoyitsa iwanu ing'awohulika woye mne ukwalangula kunoghile ka iwanu iwomuhulika Imulungu, katsowatenda iwanu weyandae kumbokela IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakariya kamghutsa imalaika, “Nitsomanyatse ka ichinu chino chakuwa apfo? Nene nilala na mwehe wangu pfipfila kalala” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Imalaika kamwidika, “Nene na Gaburieli. Nakwima hanu he Imulungu, iyanitumile nonge naghwe, na nikulongele imbuli ino inoghile. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kwitsenyamala tulu kwaapfila ng'ughatoghola bae aghano ighatsolawila mna msimu wake, ng'utsodaha bae ukulonga mbaka aghano ghanikulongele haghotsolawila.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Iwanu iwang'ali wombeta Sakariya wetsina hayang'ali yokawa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Baho halawile kunze, ng'adahile bae ukulonga nawo, apfo wamanya kona ghamaono mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kalonga nawo kwa ghamoko ghake, kwaapfila ng'adahile bae ukulonga.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Matsuwa ghake gha kusang'ana aghamalile, Sakariya koya ukaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Aghabitile matsuwa mengi mwehe wake kakinda inda. Tsakepfisa mng'anda kwa miyetsi mitano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Tsakalonga, “Apfi pfipfo pfanendele Imulungu mna matsuwa ghala hambonele libatsi kunenda ndeke kona keli ichinyala mne iwanu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu kwolangusighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mna ghumwetsi ghwa sita ghwe inda ya Elizabeti Imulungu kamtuma malaika yokemighwa Gaburieli aghende mne ghumji ghwa Natsareti mne isi ya Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kwe imwali iyalapfighwe tsengele ne immale yakemighwe Yosefu, yalawile mne lukolo lwa Mndewa Daudi. Imwaliyo tsakakemighwa Mariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Malaika tsakamtsila imwaliyo kamlongela, “Haulamke! IMNDEWA kahamwe naghwe, naye kakubaliki!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya hayahulike mbuli ayo, tsakalangula mne ghumoyo ghwake, naye kakangawala imbuli ino ina mana yachi. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Malaika kamlongela, “Mariya, uleke kupfuka! Imulungu kakutendela uluso. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kutsokinda inda na kutsakweleka imwana immale, kutsomwing'a taghwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Katsakuwa mkulu na katsokemighwa Imwana we Imulungu yali Kuchanya Ng'ani. IMNDEWA Imulungu katsomwing'a chighoda cha undewa che imbala wake Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Katsokuwa imndewa we iwana wa Yakobu ghamatsuwa ghose, ne undewa wake ng'autsomala bae!” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya kalonga ne malaika, “Nene namwali sina niwase bae ne immale. Kuya lelo itsakuwatse?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Malaika kamwidika, “Ghumuhe Mwenzeka katsokutsila, na ngupfu tse Imulungu tsitsokughubika. Apfo imwana mwenzeluka katsakwelekighwa, katsokemighwa Imwana we Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Kwomkumbuka ndughu yako Elizabeti. Tsailongighwa ng'atsokweleka bae iwana, lekeni sambi kana inda ya miyetsi sita, pfipfo pfayali mnzehe. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwaapfila kuduhu ichinu Imulungu ng'ochidaha bae kuchitenda.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya kalonga; “Nene na imtumwa we IMNDEWA, nendelighwe ka pfaulongile.” Kuya malaika ayo koka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariya komwangila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 1:39-45">Luk 1:39-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Matsuwa ghaghala Mariya katsumka kaghenda mne ghumji ighuli mne pfidunda pfa isi ya Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ako kengila mne ing'anda ya Sakariya, kamlamsa Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elisabeti hayahulike Mariya komlamsa, imwana kadaluka munda mwake. Elisabeti kamemetsighwa na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />kalonga kwa kukemelela, “Kubweda kubita iwapinga wose, ne imwana yutsomweleka kabalikiighwa! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ebali chinu chino chindawila nene, mbaka mai we IMNDEWA wangu yanyangile nene? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Hanihulike kwondamsa, imwana kadaluka munda mwangu kwa ndeng'elelo. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Ng'apfu ghweghwe yutoghole ka ghatsolawila aghala ghayakulongele IMNDEWA”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ghumoyo ghwangu ghomtoghola IMNDEWA;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />ghumoyo ghwangu ghwomdeng'elela Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">iyali Mkombotsi wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kwaapfila kaukumbuka udodo we imtumwa wake!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kulawa sambi na kughendelela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">iwanu wose watsong'ema na imunu iyebwedile<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kwaapfila Imulungu yane Ngupfu kanendela makulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Taghwa lye Imulungu lyenzeluka.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kowonela libatsi iwanu wala iwompfuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">libatsi lyake lyokala lweleko mbaka lweleko lungi <verse eid="LUK 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Tsakatenda ipfinu pfikulu kwa ghumoko ghwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Kawapwililisa iwanu iweghodile mne imimoyo yawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Kawahulumsa iwandewa kulawa kune ipfighoda pfawo pfa undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">na kawenula iwali mbughilambughila.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Kawaghutisa wane inzala kwa pfinu pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">na kawawinga matajiri ghamoko ghaliyeka.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kamwapfila imtumwa wake Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">na ng'esemwile bae kumlangusa libatsi lyake.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Kakumbuka kumwonela libatsi Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">na lukolo lwake ghamatsuwa ghose!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya kakala na Elizabeti kwa miyetsi midatu, kuya koya ukaye yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekighwa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Matsuwa gha Elisabeti tsaghapfika ukweleka imwana, naye keleka imwana immale. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Iwanu wali habehi yake ne iwandughu tsake hawahulike Imulungu pfamwonele libatsi sideke, wose wadeng'elela naye. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Imwana hapfikile matsuwa manane, watsa kumwingitsa ngoma. Wabama kumwing'a taghwa Sakariya, taghwa lya aba wake. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kuya mai wake kalonga, “Bae! Taghwa lyake katsokemighwa Yohane!” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Walonga, “Pfii mbona kwahela ndughu iyokemighwa taghwa lino mlukolo lwako!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Kuya walonga kwa ghamoko na aba wake wamghutsa taghwa lyachi kobama imwanaghe yakemighwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakariya kalomba chibao cho kwandikila, kuya kandika, “Taghwa lyake Yohane.” Wose wakangawala! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bahala Zakariya kadaha ukulonga keli, kandusa ukumtunya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Iwanu wali habehi yake wapfuka, na mbuli tse ipfinu pfino tsenela kwose kune ipfidunda pfe isi ya Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Chila imunu yahulike imbuli ino kalangula, keghutsa, “Pfii imwana yuno atsakuwa mwana wachi?” Kwaapfila ingupfu ye IMNDEWA yakwoneka ghendo ikala naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utabili wa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakariya aba wake Yohane kamemesighwa na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, naye katabili imbuli kulawa kwe Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Lekani tumtunye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Kwaapfila kawatsila iwanu wake na kuwakombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Katwing'a twetwe Mkombotsi yane ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mtsukulu wa imtumwa wake Daudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ka pfalongile kulawa ghumwande kubitila manabii wake wahenzeluka.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kutukombola kulawa kwe iwehile wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa kune ingupfu ya wose iwotwihila.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Tsakalonga katsowonela libatsi iwabala wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na katsokumbuka lilaghano lyake lyenzeluke.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Kelighita ghendo kwa Abrahamu imbala wetu<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />katsotukombola kulawa kwe iwanu iwotwihila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Na katwapfila tudahe kumsang'anila bila kupfuka,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />tuwe wenzeluka na tuwe iwanu wanoghile hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">matsuwa ghose gha ughima wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ghweghwe imwanangu, kutsokemighwa nabii we Imulungu yali Uchanya ng'ani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Kutsomlongolela IMNDEWA umgholosele inzila yake.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Kuwalongela iwanu wake watsokombolighwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kuleghusighwa nzambi tsawo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Imulungu wetu kana libatsi na ghumoyo ghunoghile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Katsowamwemwesela ghumwanga ghwa ukombotsi kulawa kulanga.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Ghutsowamwemwesela iwanu wose iwali mne ichisi na sisila lya ifwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">aghalongotse maghulu ghetu mne nzila iili tseghamba.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Imwana kakula na kongetseka ingupfu mmuhe. Kakala kunyika mbaka litsuwa hawalawilile iwanu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ghamatsuwa ghala Agusto, Imndewa wa Roma, tsakalaghitsa iwanu wose wa undewa wa Roma wapetighwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Aluno lwa mwanduso kwe iwanu kupetighwa, Kurenio hawile mkulu we isi ya Siriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Kuya, chila imunu kaghenda kune ghumji ghwake kwandikighwa taghwa lyake.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yosefu kalawa ghumji ghwa Natsareti ighuli mna isi ya Galilaya, kaghenda ghumji ghwa Betilehemu ighuli mna isi ya Yudeya, hanu helekighwe mndewa Daudi. Yosefu kaghenda ako kwaapfila kalawila mne lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Kaghenda na Mariya kupetighwa, ipinga yamlapfile tsengele, yakalile ne inda. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Hawang'ali wa Betilehemu, litsuwa lyake lya ukweleka lipfika, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />keleka imwanaghe chaudele, kampfatsa pfibwende. Kuya kamuwasitsa mne ichibumbulika hanu hawajilagha iwanyama, kwaapfila ng'awapatile bae hanu ho kukala mne ing'anda ya iwahenza.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi we iwang'olo na Wamalaika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:8-20">Luk 2:8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mna isi iila tsakukala na wadimi iwang'ali wokalitsa imipfugho yawo nechilo.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">2. Iwadimi wololesa wang'olo wawo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Imalaika we IMNDEWA kawalawila, ne utunitso we IMNDEWA uwamwemwesela, nawo wapfuka ghendo. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Lekeni malaika ayo kawalongela, “Mleke ukupfuka! Niwaghalila imbuli inoghile, iitsowadeng'eletsa iwanu wose. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Leloli kune ghumji ghwa Daudi kelekighwa Mkombotsi wenu; yeye iyo Kiristu, IMNDEWA! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Achino chitsakuwa chitango kuna mwemwe. Mtsomwona imwana mdodo, wampfatsa ipfibwende, wamuwatsisa hanu ho kujila iwanyama.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Bahala, kingili kulu lye iwamalaika litingana ne malaika ayo, wamtunya Imulungu, walonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Utunitso kwe Imulungu yali uchanya ng'ani kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na tseghamba kwe iwanu iwali mne isi yose iwanoghelighwe naye.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Iwamalaika awo hawoyile kulanga, wadimi welongela, “Tukeni Betilehemu tukalole acho ichilawile, chatulongele IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Apfo watsuma, wawapfika Mariya na Yosefu, na ayula imwana mdodo kawasitsighwa hanu ho ukujila iwanyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Wadimi awo hawamwonile imwana yula, wawalongela mbuli tse imwana tsawalongile malaika. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Wose iwahulike agho, wakangawala na mbuli tsawalongile wadimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Lekeni Mariya kagheka agha ghose mna ghumoyo ghwake na kaghatonga ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Awala iwadimi woya kunyika, wamtunya Imulungu na kumwimbila kwa ghose ghawahulike na ghawonile, ghose ghalawila ka malaika pfawalongele.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imwana kakwing'ighwa taghwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mne litsuwa lya nane, litsuwa lya kumwingitsa ngoma imwana halipfikile, kakemighwa taghwa lyake Yesu. Taghwa alyo tsakeng'ighwa na malaika ahala mai wake ng'ana ame inda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kune Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ghamatsuwa tsaghapfika gha Yosefu na Mariya kutenda ichihendo cha kudeghetetsighwa ka Ghamalaghitso gha Musa pfagholaghitsa. Apfo wamsola imwana, waghenda naye kune ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu kumwika hambele he IMNDEWA, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ka pfayandikighwe mne Ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA Imulungu; “Chila imwana immale chaudele alapfighwe kwe IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kuya tsawaghenda ili watambike, walapfe njiwa weli au makinda meli ka Ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA pfagholaghitsa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ako Yerusalemu tsakukala na imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Simoni. Imunu ayo tsakakala kanogha na kompfuka Imulungu. Ayo yang'ali yobetetsa ukutsa kwa ukombotsi wa Isiraeli, naye tsakakala na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kamlongela ng'atsakufa bae mbaka amwone Kiristu yasaghulighwe ne IMNDEWA. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Kuya Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu kamlongotsa Simoni kaghenda kune Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kuya aba na mai wake Yesu wamghala imwana wawo mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu wamtendele ka pfaibamighwe mne ichihendo cha Ghamalaghitso gha Musa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simoni kamsola imwana Yesu mna ghamoko ghake, kuya kamtunya Imulungu, kalonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Sambi IMNDEWA, mlekelele imtumwa wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">yoke tseghamba, ka pfulongile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwa tsinenge tsangu niwona ukombotsi wako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />uutendile woneke kuna iwanu wose,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ghumwanga ighutsowamwemwesela iwanu wose iwali si Wayahudi bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na litsoghala utunitso kwe iwanu wako wa Isiraeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Aba wake na mai wake Yesu wang'ali wokangawala na mbuli tse imwana tsayalongile Simoni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simoni kawabaliki, kamlongela Mariya, mai wake Yesu, “Imwana yuno kasaghulighwa ne Imulungu kwa ukwagha na ukukombolighwa kwe iwanu wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli. Kuya katsakuwa chitango kulawa kwe Imulungu, ichitsolemighwa ne iwanu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Kuya ukwalangula mne imimoyo ye iwanu wengi kutsoghubulighwa mwatsi. Naghwe imwenyegho, usungu ka lipanga ilitema utsouhoma ghumoyo ghwako.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Tsakukala na nabii yumwe pinga, kakala mnzehe ghendo, tagwa lyake Ana, neghe Fanuweli, wa lukolo lwa Aseri. Ipinga ayo tsakakala na immale wake kwa miyaka saba kulawa kukwelighwa kwake. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Kuya tsakakala chitsuka mbaka matsuwa ghala ghawile mnzehe wa miyaka semanini na mine. Na matsuwa agho ghose kakala mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, ang'ali yofunga ukuja na ukulomba chilo na misi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Saa iila ipinga ayo kalawila, kamlongela Imulungu mighede, kawalongela imbuli ye imwana yula kwe iwanu wose yawang'ali woubetela ukombotsi wa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yosefu na Mariya hawaghamalitse ghose ighobamighwa na Ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA Imulungu, tsawoya ukaye yawo Natsareti, mne ghumji ghwa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Imwana kakula, kongetseka ngupfu, kamema ihekima, na uluso we Imulungu ukala hamwe naye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imsongolo Yesu kamne ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Chila mwaka mne chihungo cha pasaka, welesi wake wang'ali woghendagha Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu hapfikile miyaka kumi na mili, tsawaghenda naye kune ichihungo ka pfawatendagha. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Hawamalitse ichihungo, na hawang'ali wakuya ukaye yawo, Yesu tsakakala kuchugho Yerusalemu, aku welesi wake ng'awamanyile bae. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Tsawepfikitsa ka tsawawose mne ghumwanza, waghenda ghumwanza ghwa tsuwa limwe. Kuya wandusa kumbama mna iwandughu tsawo na sale tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ng'awamwonile bae, apfo woya Yerusalemu kumbama.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Mna litsuwa lya kadatu, wampfika mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu mghati mwe iwalangulitsi wa Chiyahudi, ang'ali yowategheletsa na ukuwaghutsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Wose watsihulike mbuli tsake wakangawala na tsimbutsi tsake na apfila pfawedike. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Weletsi wake hawamwonile wakangawala ng'ani. Mai wake kamghutsa, “Mwanangu, ebali ututenda apfi? Nene na aba wako tung'ali tukubama kwa usungu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu kawedika, “Angu mnibamila choni? Ng'ammanyile bae nene nibamighwa nikale mne ing'anda ya Aba wangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Lekeni wao ng'awamanyile bae imbuli yawalongele ina mana yachi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Kuya, koya nawo mbaka Natsareti ako ang'ali yowahulikitsa. Mai wake keka ipfinu pfose mne ghumoyo ghwake. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Na Yesu kakula na kongetseka ihekima na utali, na kumnoghelesa Imulungu ne iwanu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tano ghwa undewa wa Mndewa Tiberi, Pontiyo Pilato tsakakala mkulu wa isi ya Yudeya, Herodi tsakakala mkulu wa Galilaya, na ndughu yake Filipi tsakakala mkulu wa Ituleya na isi ya Tilakoniti, na Lusaniya tsakakala mkulu wa Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi na Kayafa tsawakala iwakulu we inambiko. Mna matsuwa agho, imbuli ye Imulungu tsaimtsila Yohane, imwana wa Sakariya akula kunyika. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Apfo, Yohane kanga isi yose iibakane na ghumto Yoridani. Kawapetela iwanu watsileke nzambi tsawo na wabatitsighwe, ili Imulungu awaleghusile nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ka pfayandikighwe mne ichitabu cha nabii Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Litsi lye imunu lyokema kulawa kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mmwikile ghoya IMNDEWA nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mgholose nzila yake.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Chila lwanda lutsomemetsighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">chila chidunda na sughulu pfitsomwaghaluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">hanu hapfeduke hatsogholosighwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila itsihile tsitsogholosighwa na kukala ghoya.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na iwanu wose watsowona ukombotsi we Imulungu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Kuya iwanu wamghendela Yohane ili awabatitse, naye kawalongela, “Mwemwe iwana we nzoka! Yuhi yawalongele mwodaha kuhepa ukuhighighwa ne Imulungu? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mtende aghala igholangusa ka mtsileka nzambi tsenu. Mleke kwilongela, ‘Abrahamu aba wetu!’ Nowalongela, kulawa mne ghamabwe ghano Imulungu kodaha kumlapfila Abrahamu iwana. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Kuya, hoya ikighwa ghoya msina mwe mibiki, apfo chila mbiki yang'aghukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile ghutsoghanighwa na kwasighwa mna ghumoto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kingili lye iwanu limghutsa, “Lelo tutandetse?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yohane kawedika, “Imunu yane ghamaghwanda meli yamwing'e yula yalihela lighwanda, na yane ichijo yatende pfipfo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nawo iwasola kodi watsa wabatitsighwe, wamghutsa, “Imlangulitsi, twetwe tutende choni?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nae kawalongela, “Mleke kusola kodi kubita pfamlaghitsighwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Nawo asikali wamghutsa, “Na twetwe tutende choni?” Naye kawedika, “Mleke kuboka ipfinu pfe imunu wowose na mleke kumbangitsila imunu wowose. Mwenele na achila chamulihighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Iwanu wang'ali wololela ipfinu ipfitsolawila, wandusa kwalangula mna imimoyo yawo mbuli tsa Yohane, pfii ayu ka Kiristu? <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Baho Yohane kawalongela wose, “Nene nowabatitsa mwemwe kwa ghamatsi, lekeni kakutsa yane ngupfu kubita nene, nene sidaha bae kumdoholela mitsabi ye imikwabatsa yake. Ayo katsowabatitsa kwa Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu na kwa ghumoto ghwa kuhigha. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ayo kana lungo mne ghamoko ghake, abetele uhemba wake, awike hamwe mne ikano yake na katsolakatsa mikumvi mne ghumoto ing'aghutsimika bae.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Apfo kwa mbuli tsingi, Yohane tsayang'ali yowapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Lekeni Yohane tsakamkembela Herodi, mkulu wa Galilaya, kwaapfila kamkwela Herodiya, mwehe wa ndughu yake, ne ipfinu pfingi pfihile pfatendile Herodi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Kuya Herodi kongetsa ichinu chingi chihile kwa kumwika Yohane mne ligheretsa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatitsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Iwanu wose hawamalile kubatitsighwa, kuya Yesu kabatitsighwa. Na hang'ali yolomba, ililanga lighubuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ghumuhulumkila mne lukuli ka lwe injiwa. Litsi kulawa kulanga lilonga, “Ghweghwe kwa Imwanangu yuninoghela, nonoghelighwa naghwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-7">Mat 1:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu handuse isang'ano yake tsakana miyaka ka selasini. Iwanu tsawepfikitsa yeye kakala imwana wa Yosefu, imwana wa Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli tsakakala imwana wa Matati, iyakalile imwana wa Lawi, imwana wa Meliki, imwana wa Yani, imwana wa Yosefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />iyakalile imwana wa Matatia, imwana wa Amosi, imwana wa Nahumu, imwana wa Hesili, imwana wa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />iyakalile imwana wa Mahati, imwana wa Matatia, imwana wa Semeyi, imwana wa Yoseki, imwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />iyakalile imwana wa Yohaneni, imwana wa Resa, imwana wa Serubabeli, imwana wa Setieli, imwana wa Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />imwana wa Meliki, imwana we Adi, imwana wa Kosamu, iyakalile imwana we Elimadamu, imwana we Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />iyakalile imwana wa Yoshua, imwana wa Eliyetseri, imwana wa Yorimu, imwana wa Matati, imwana wa Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />iyakalile imwana wa Simoni, imwana wa Yuda, imwana wa Yosefu, imwana wa Yonamu, imwana we Eliyakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />iyakalile imwana wa Maleya, imwana wa Mena, imwana wa Matata, imwana wa Natani, imwana wa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />iyakalile imwana wa Yese, imwana wa Obedi, imwana wa Boasi, imwana wa Salimoni, imwana wa Nasoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />iyakalile imwana wa Aminadabu, imwana we Adimini, imwana we Arini, imwana wa Hesironi, imwana wa Peresi, imwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />iyakalile imwana wa Yakobu, imwana we Isaka, imwana we Abrahamu, imwana wa Tera, imwana wa Nahori, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />iyakalile imwana wa Serugi, imwana wa Reyu, imwana wa Pelegi, imwana wa Eberi, imwana wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />iyakalile imwana wa Kainamu, imwana wa Arifakisadi, imwana wa Shemu, imwana wa Nuhu, imwana wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />iyakalile imwana wa Metusela, imwana wa Enoki, imwana wa Yaredi, imwana wa Mahalaleli, imwana wa Kainamu, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />iyakalile imwana wa Enosi, imwana wa Seti, imwana wa Adamu, iyakalile imwana we Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kughetsigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malk 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu kalawa mne ghumto Yoridani kamema Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, na Ghumuhe haghwo ghumlongotsa mbaka kunyika. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ako kaghetsighwa na Setani kwa matsuwa alubaini. Mne agho, ng'ajile bae chinu chochose, na matsuwa agho haghamalile tsakona nzala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Setani kamlongela; “Ka ghweghwe kwe Imwana wa Imulungu, ulilongele libwe lino liwe chighate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikighwa, ‘Imunu ng'odaha bae kuwa mghima kwa kuja chighate chiliyeka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Bahala Setani kamlongotsa Yesu mbaka kuchanya, kamlangusa undewa wose uli mne isi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Setani kamlongela, “Nitsokwing'a undewa na ukulu mne pfinu pfose pfino, kwaapfila pfose pfamne ghamoko ghangu, na nene nodaha kumwing'a imunu wowose yanimbama.” <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />“Nitsokwing'a ipfinu pfose pfino ka kutsonitambikila.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu kamwidika, “Yandikighwa, ‘Umtambikile IMNDEWA Imulungu wako, ne umsang'anile yeye yaliyeka!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Kuya Setani kamlongotsa mbaka kune ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, mchiswili mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu, wilaghatse kulawa hano mbaka hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kwaapfila yandikighwa, ‘Imulungu katsowalaghitsa wamalaika wake wakulolese. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Nawo watsokukinda mne ghamoko ghao, uleke kwikwala ghumghulu ghwako mne libwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Ilongighwa, ‘Uleke kumghetsa IMNDEWA Imulungu wako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Setani hayamalitse kumghetsa Yesu kwa chila chinu, kamleka chidogho.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwandusa sang'ano yake Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Kuya Yesu koya mne isi ya Galilaya kamema ingupfu ya Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. Mbuli tsake tsenela Galilaya na mne tsiisi itsili habehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yang'ali yolangulitsa mne tsing'anda tsawo tsa ukulombela na iwanu wose wamtunya.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Kuya Yesu koya Natsareti hanu hayalelighwe. Mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, kaghenda mne ing'anda ye ukulombela ka pfayatsowele. Kema na kusoma Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Keng'ighwa ichitabu cha nabii Isaya. Kachipfughula, kahona hanu handikighwe,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Ghumuhe ghwe IMNDEWA ghwa hachanya hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwaapfila kanisaghula nene niwaghalile wahingwa imbuli inoghile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Kanituma niwapetele iwohighwe ka watsolekelighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ne ipfifita watsokona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na kuwalekelela iwanu iwoghaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kuwalongela ka matsuwa ghapfika</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">ghe IMNDEWA kuwakombola iwanu wake.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu kachighubika ichitabu, kamwing'a imtumwa, kuya kakala hasi. Iwanu wose mne ing'anda ye ukulombela wamtsodolela tsinenge. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Naye kawalongela, “Ighandikighwe leloli ghatimila mne ghamaghutwi ghenu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Wose wamtoghola, wakangawala na mbuli tsinoghile tsalongile. Walonga, “Angu ayu si imwana wa Yosefu bae?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nomanya mwodaha kunilongela imbuli ino, ‘Imghanga, wihonetse imwenyegho! Ghose ghatuhulike ghutendile akula Kaperinaumu, pfipfila ghatende hano ukaye yako’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Kaghendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, nabii ng'otogholighwa bae ukaye yake.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />“Mnitegheletse! Nowalongelani ghendo tsakukala na pfitsuka wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli mna matsuwa gha nabii Eliya. matsuwa agho imvula ng'aitowile bae kwa miyaka midatu na miyetsi sita, apfo tsakukala ne inzala ng'ulu mne isi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Eliya ng'atumighwe bae kwe chitsuka wowose, lekeni katumighwa kwe chitsuka yumwe iyakalile Sarefati mne isi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Mna matsuwa gha nabii Elisha tsakukala ne iwanu wengi mne isi ya Isiraeli iwoghula ukoma. Kuduhu imunu wowose yahonile, lekeni Naamani yaliyeka, imunu wa isi ya Siria.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Iwanu wose mne Ing'anda ye ukulombela hawahulike apfi wona maya ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Wenuka, wamghala Yesu kunze kwa ghumji, na wamghala mchidando mwe chidunda, hanu ihatsengighwe kaye tsawo. Wabama wamwase kulwanda, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />lekeni kabita mghati mwe kingili, koka.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlapfa ichinyamkela kulawa kune imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Malk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kuya Yesu kahulumka Kaperinaumu, ghumji ghwa Galilaya. Na mne litsuwa lya Sabato kandusa kuwalangulitsa iwanu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Tsawakangawala kwa malangulitso ghake, kwaapfila ghalangulitse tsa ghana ngupfu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mne ing'anda ye ukulombela tsa kuna imunu yane ichinyamkela yehile, kakemelela kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ubama kututenda choni, Yesu wa Natsareti? Kutsa kutukoma? Nokumanya ghweghwe kwa Imtumighwa Mwenzeluka we Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, “Winyamale, umlawe imunu yuno!” Kuya ichinyamkela kamghwisa hasi imunu ayo hambele hawo, kamlawa bila kumlagha.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Iwanu wose wakangawala ng'ani, welongela, “Ahino mbuli yachi lelo? Imunu yuno kodaha na kana ngupfu tsa kuwakembela ipfinyamkela, nawo womuhulika!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Apfo mbuli tsa Yesu tsenela mne isi yose ya Galilaya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu kalawa mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kaghenda mne ing'anda ya Simoni. Mai wake mwehe wa Simoni yang'ali yoghula homa kali ng'ani, wamlomba Yesu amuhonetse mai ayo. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Apfo kaghenda kema habehi na mai ayo, kaukembela utamu. Nawo utamu umlawa, bahala kenuka, kandusa kuwatumikila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Litsuwa haling'ali lyotsama, iwanu wamghalila Yesu iwanu iwang'ali woghula chila utamu, naye keka ghamoko ghake mwa chila mtamu, kawahonetsa wose. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ipfinyamkela tsawawalawa iwanu wengi na kudama, “Ghweghwe kwe Imwana wa Imulungu!” Yesu kawakembela na kuwaghoma kulonga, kwaapfila tsawammanya yeye kakala Kiristu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu mne ing'anda ye ukulombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Malk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Lupfilipfili Yesu kaghenda kunze kwe ghumji hanu halihela imunu. Iwanu wandusa kumbama, na hawamwonile wabama kumghoma aleke kuka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Lekeni kawalongela, “Pfipfila nobamighwa kuwapetela iwanu Mbuli Inoghile ye Undewa we Imulungu kune imiji ingi, kwaapfila acho chicho Imulungu chanitumile kuchitenda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Apfo kaghendelela ukuwapetela iwanu mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela mne isi yose ya Yudeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema iwatumighwa wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu tsakema mmbalimbali mwa tsiwa Genesareti, baho iwanu wammemela na kumkunughitsa kunughitsa, wategheletsa Imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kayona minumbwi mili mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ilekighwe na iwalowa somba iwang'ali wohopfugha nyapfu tsao. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi ghumwe ghwa Simoni, kamlongela aghusoghetse mnumbwi chidogho kulawa mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu mbaka mne ghamatsi. Kuya kakala hasi na kalangulitsa mtingano ghwe iwanu aku kamne mnumbwi.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Hayamalitse kulonga, kamlongela Simoni, “Usoghetse mnumbwi ghupfike haghatighati, kuya utsase nyapfu tsako mne ghamatsi upfule iwasomba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni kamwidika, “IMNDEWA! Tusang'ana ichilo chose ng'atupatile ichinu bae. Lekeni kwaapfila kulonga apfo, notsasa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Watsasa nyapfu tsao na wapfula iwasomba wengi ng'ani mbaka nyapfu tsao tsandusa kudegheka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Apfo wawabengutsa wayawo iwakalile mne mnumbwi ghungi watse wawapfile. Wapfika, waweka iwasomba mne minumbwi yose mili mbaka ibama kutsama. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petiri hayonile achila ichilawile, kamtowela Yesu maghoti kalonga, “Ughende IMNDEWA! Nene ne imunu yane nzambi!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na weyaghe wakangawala kwe iwasomba wengi wawalowile. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Pfipfila weyaghe Simoni, Jakobu na Yohane, iwanaghe Sebedayo nawo wakangawala. Yesu kamlongela Simoni, “Uleke kupfuka, kulawa sambi na kughendelela kutsowapfula iwanu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Waikwegha minumbwi yawo mbaka mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, waleka chila ichinu, wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu hang'ali mne ghumji ghumwe, tsakatsa imunu yane ukoma lukuli lwose. Imtamu ayo hamwonile Yesu, keghwisa hasi, kalomba “IMNDEWA, ka kwobama, kwodaha kunitenda nihone!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu kagholosa ghumoko, kamkinda, kalonga, “Nobama; Uhone!” Bahala ukoma umlawa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu kamlongela, “Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose. Lekeni ughende, wilanguse kwe imbala we inambiko ne ulapfe inambiko ka Musa pfawalongele, iwanu wose wamanye ka ghweghwe kuhona.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lekeni mbuli tsa Yesu tsongetseka kwenela mne isi yose, na iwanu wengi wapfika kumtegheletsa na wambama awahonetse utamu wawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Lekeni Yesu tsakaghenda hanu halihela imunu, ako kalomba.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu yang'ali yolangulitsa. Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso iwalawile mne imiji ya Galilaya, Yudeya na Yerusalemu tsawakala bahala. Ngupfu ye IMNDEWA tsaikala naye kwa kuwahonetsa iwatamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Iwanu wangi wapfika, wamduta machela mne lutsatsi imunu yaholole, wabama wamghale mng'anda, hambele ha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Lekeni ng'awadahile bae, kwaapfila tsahana iwanu wengi sideke. Apfo wamghala, wamwika mchiswili, wafumla kuya wahulumsa machela mbaka haghatighati he iwanu awo, hayali Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Iwanu wane womuhulumsa imunu kulawa mchiswili</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu honile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu yaholole, “Sale yangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo wandusa kwighutsa, “Ayuno imunu wachi iyomligha Imulungu? Yuhi iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi? Angu si Imulungu yaliyeka iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, kawaghutsa, “Mkwalangula choni mne imimoyo yenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Chihi chibewe; kulonga ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa’ au kulonga ‘Winuke ughende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nobama mmanye, Imwana we Imunu kana uwetso wa kuleghusa nzambi mne iisi.” Apfo kamlongela imunu yaholole, “Nokulongela, winuke usole chilagho chako uye ukaye!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bahala imunu ayo kenuka hambele hawo, kasola chilagho chake. Koka ukaye yake aku komtunya Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Iwanu wose wakangawala ghendo! Wapfuka na wamtunya Imulungu, walonga, “Leloli tupfona ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Haghamalile agho, Yesu kalawa kunze kamwona imunu iyosola kodi yakemighwe Lawi kakala mne ing'anda ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamlongela, “Uniwinze.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi kenuka, kaleka chila chinu kamuwinza.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Kuya Lawi kamtendela Yesu chihungo chikulu mne ing'anda yake, na kingili kulu lye iwanu iwasola kodi ne iwanu wangi tsawabahala. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Lekeni Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wangi iwalawile mne kingili lyawo wawanung'unikila iwanang'ina wa Yesu, “Ebali mwakuja na kunwa hamwe ne iwanu iwasola kodi na wane nzambi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu kawedika, “Iwanu iwaghima ng'awombama bae imghanga, ila awala iwatamu iwo iwombama imghanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Sitsile bae kuwakema iwanu iwanoghile, ila wane nzambi wadahe kutsileka.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya kufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Iwanu wangi wamlongela Yesu, “Iwanang'ina wa Yohane wafungagha ukuja na kulomba, na iwatumighwa wa Mafarisayo wotenda pfipfo. Lekeni iwanang'ina wako wakuja na kunwa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu kedika, “Apfi mwodaha kuwaghoma iwanu iwakemighwe kune chihungo cha kukwela waleke ukuja ahala imunu yokwela ang'ali nawo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Lekeni litsuwa lyakutsa imunu yokwela hatsosolighwa kulawa mna wawo, na baho watsofunga ukuja.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Kuduhu imunu iyodegha ichiraka kulawa mne lighwanda lya sambi na kuchika mne lighwanda lya ghumwande. Ka kotenda apfo, katsolidegha lighwanda lya sambi, na ichiraka kulawa mne lighwanda lya sambi ng'achitsolingana bae na lighwanda lya ghumwande. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Na kuduhu imunu iyoghuma dipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ye ingotsi ya ghumwande. Kwaapfila ka kotenda apfo, dipfai ya sambi itsoitula imikoba hayo, dipfai itsakwitika na imikoba itsohinyika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Lekeni dipfai ya sambi yobamighwa ighumighwe mne imikoba ya sambi! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kuduhu imunu iyakunwa dipfai ya ghumwande na kuya abame dipfai ya sambi, kwaapfila kolonga, ‘Ya ghumwande inogha.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Litsuwa limwe lya sabato Yesu ang'ali yobita mne imighunda ya uhemba. Iwanang'ina wake wandusa kukwanyula mikungwi ya uhemba, waifighisa mne ghamoko ghawo waja. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafarisayo wangi waghutsa, “Ebali mwotenda ichinu ichighomighwe mne litsuwa lya Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi ng'amsomile bae achila chatendile Daudi na wayaghe hawakalile ne inzala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Daudi tsakengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kasola pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu kapfija. Pfipfila kaweng'a wayaghe. Ghamalaghitso ghomghoma imunu wowose kupfija pfighate apfo, ila ipfilongotsi we inambiko waliyeka iwabamighwe kupfija.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Imwana we Imunu kana ukulu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu yane ghumoko ghuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mne Litsuwa lingi lya Sabato, Yesu tsakaghenda kulangulitsa mne ing'anda ya ukulombela. Mne ing'anda ila ye ukulombela tsakukala ne imunu yaholole ghumoko ghwa ukujila. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wangi na Mafarisayo tsawabama imbuli ya kumghoghela Yesu. Apfo wamlolesa ka ang'amuhonetse imunu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Lekeni Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, kamlongela imunu ayo yaholole ghumoko, “Utse wime hano.” Imunu ayo kenuka, kema hala. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Nowaghutseni mwemwe, apfi mna Litsuwa lya Sabato pfinogha kutenda ghanoghile au kutenda ghehile? Kuukombola ughima we imunu au kuukoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Kawalolesa iwanu wose iwali hala, kuya kamlongela imunu ayo, “Ugholose ghumoko ghwako.” Katenda ka Yesu pfamlongele, na ghumoko ghwake ghuhonetsighwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Lekeni iwanu wona maya wandusa kwilongela iwenyegho ichinu chachi wamtendele Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowasaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mna matsuwa agho Yesu kagheluka kuchidunda, kakala meso chilo chose komlomba Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Nemitondo haipfikile, Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake. Kawasaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli kulawa mumula mne kingili lyawo, kaweng'a taghwa iwatumighwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni, Yesu kamwing'a taghwa lya keli Petiri, na ndughu yake Andereya, Jakobu, Yohane, Filipi, Batalomeyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matei na Tomasi na Jakobu imwana we Alifayo na Simoni iyakemighwe Zelote, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda imwana wa Jakobu na Yuda Isikarioti, yamhunduke Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa na kuwahonetsa iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu hayahulumke kuchidunda na iwatumighwa wake, kema mlwanda na kingili kulu lye iwanang'ina wake. Iwanu wengi tsawabahala iwalawile tsiisi tsose tsa Yudeya, Yerusalemu na walawile mne tsiisi tsa kumwani tsa Tiro na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Iwanu awo watsa kumtegheletsa Yesu na kuhonetsighwa matamu ghawo. Pfipfila iwanu wala iwadununzighwe ne ipfinyamkela watsa wahonetsighwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Iwanu wose tsawabama kumkinda Yesu, kwaapfila ingupfu ing'ali imlawa na iwahonetsa wose.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukudeng'a na usungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu kawalola iwanang'ina wake kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mbweda mwemwe wahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwaapfila Undewa we Imulungu iwo wenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mbweda mwemwe yamne nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaapfila mwitseghuta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mbweda mwemwe yamlila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaapfila mtsosekelela!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mbweda ka iwanu watsowahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">watsowabaghula na watsowaligha na watsolonga mwemwe mwiha, kwaajili ye Imwana we Imunu!<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Deng'eleleni na kubigha agho haghotsolawila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">kwaapfila ghweko lyenu kulu likighwa kulanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">Apfo pfipfo iwabala wawo pfawawatendele manabii.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Lekeni mtsoghaya mwemwe matajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwaapfila mwemwe ma tsambokela ughima unoghile!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamwighutile sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaapfila hambele mtsakona inzala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mtsoghaya mwemwe yamsekelela sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaapfila hambele mtsoghanzika no kulila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mtsoghaya ka iwanu wose</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">watsowatogholani mwemwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">Kwaapfila apfo pfipfo iwabala wawo pfawawatendele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">manabii wa ughutsu.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Kuwanoghela iwowehila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mat 7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Lekeni nowalongela mwemwe yamnihulika, muwanoghele iwehile wenu, muwatendele ghanoghile iwanu wala iwowehila. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muwabaliki iwanu wala iwowalighita, na muwalombele kwe Imulungu iwanu wala iwowatendela ghehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ka imunu wowose kakutowa mna likanza limwe, pfipfila mleke akutowe likanza liyaghe, ka imunu kolisola likoti lyako, pfipfila mleke asole lighwanda lyako. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mwing'eni chila imunu cholomba, ka imunu wowose kakuboka ichinu chako, uleke kumlongela akuyitsile. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muwatendele iwanu wangi achila chambama mwemwe wawatendele.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Mng'awanoghela iwanu wala iwomnoghelani mwemwe, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Hata ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ pfipfila wowanoghela iwanu wala iwowanoghela! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mng'awatendela ghanoghile iwanu wala iwowatendela ghanoghile, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Pfipfila ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ wotenda pfipfo! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Mng'awakopesha iwanu wala yamuwalolela watsomuyitsilani, apfi uluso wachi wamlangusa? Pfipfila ‘iwanu wane nzambi’ wowakopesha wayawo, na kuwalolela wawoyitsile. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Lekeni wanogheleni iwowahila mwemwe na muwatendele ghanoghile, muwakopeshe iwanu na mleke kulolela ka watsowoyitsila. Kuya ghweko lyenu litsakuwa kulu, na mtsakuwa iwana we Imulungu iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani. Kwaapfila yeye kanogha kwe iwanu yang'awolonga mighede ne iwanu wehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Muwe na libatsi, ka Aba wenu pfali na libatsi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwahigha iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mleke kuwahigha wayenu, ne Imulungu ng'atsowahighani bae. Mleke kuwadununza wayenu, ne Imulungu ng'atsowadununzani bae. Muwalekele wayenu, ne Imulungu katsowalekeleni. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muweng'e iwanu wangi, ne Imulungu katsomwing'ani. Namwe mtsobokela ichipimo chimemile mbaka chakwitika. Kwaapfila ichipimo chamtumila kwe iwanu wangi, Imulungu katsochitumila chicho kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Imunu chifita ng'odaha bae kumlongotsa chifita miyaghe, ka katsotenda apfo, wose weli watsakughwila mwikolongo. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kuduhu mwanang'ina mkulu kubita mlangulitsi wake. Lekeni chila mwanang'ina iyamalitse ghamalangulitso ghake, kakuwa ka imlangulitsi wake.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Ebali kwochona chibanzi ichili mnenge mwa miyagho, lekeni ng'aulyona bae biki ili mnenge mwako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Apfi kwodaha kumlongela ndughu yako, ‘Ndughu yangu, leka nikulapfe chibanzi chili mnenge mwako,’ naghwe ghumwenyegho ng'ulyona bae biki ilili mnenge mwako? Ghweghwe kwa mng'enye! Tanu ulilapfe libiki lili mnenge mwako, kuya kutsolola ghoya na kuchilapfa chibanzi chili mnenge mwa ndughu yako.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbiki na ghamatunda ghake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">Mat 12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Mbiki ghunoghile ng'aghukweleka bae ghamatunda ghehile, pfipfila kuduhu mbiki ghuhile ighwukweleka ghamatunda ghanoghile. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Chila mbiki ghwomanyika kwa ghamatunda ighukweleka, iwanu ng'awobawa bae mapela mne tsimiwa au ukubawa fifi mne miyonga. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Imunu yanoghile kolapfa ipfinu pfinoghile kulawa hanu hanoghile ipfikighwe mne ghumoyo ghwake, imunu yehile kolapfa ipfinu pfihile kulawa hanu hehile ipfikighwe mne ghumoyo ghwake. Kwaapfila imunu kolonga achila ichimemile mne ghumoyo ghwake.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu weli iwotsenga ing'anda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Ebali mwonikema ‘Mtwatsa, Mtwatsa’ aku ng'amtenda bae achila chaniwalongele mchitende? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Nitsowalangusa kakonekatse imunu wowose yula iyonitsila nene na kutsitegheletsa mbuli tsangu na kutenda ka pfobamighwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ayu keghala ne imunu yatsengile ing'anda kwa kuhimba ng'ani mne libambalawe, na kutsenga ing'anda ayo mchanya mwake. Imvula ng'ulu haitowile ghamatsi ng'aghadahile bae kuyughitsa ing'anda, kwaapfila itsengighwa ghoya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Lekeni imunu iyotegheletsa mbuli tsangu na ng'otenda ka pfobamighwa, ayu keghala ne imunu yatsengile ing'anda mne msanga, bila ukuhimba ng'ani. Imvula ng'ulu haitowile, ghamatsi ghayughitsa ing'anda na kuighwisa, ne ing'anda yose ibomoka.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imtumwa we imkulu wa asikali wa Roma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu hayamalitse ukulonga ipfinu pfino kwe iwanu, kaghenda Kaperinaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ako tsakukala ne imkulu yumwe we asikali miya imwe wa Roma, naye kakala ne imtumwa wake iyamnoghele ng'ani. Na imtumwa ayo ang'ali yoghula chidogho yafe.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Imkulu wa asikali miya imwe wa Roma,</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Imkulu ayo hayahulike mbuli tsa Yesu, kawatuma iwabala wangi wa Wayahudi wamlombe Yesu atse amhonetse imtumwa wake. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Wamghendela Yesu, wamlomba ng'ani, walonga, “Umwapfile imunu yuno, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kwaapfila kowanoghela iwanu wetu, naye iyo iyatutsengele ing'anda ye ukulombela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Apfo Yesu kaghenda nawo. Hapfikile habehi ne ing'anda ye imkulu ayo, imkulu ayo kawatuma sale tsake wamlongele Yesu, “IMNDEWA, uleke kwitsupfa kutsa kuno. Nene sinoghile bae ghweghwe kwingila mng'anda mwangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Ndo mana tsambona nene sinoghile bae kukutsila ghweghwe. Lekeni ulonge imbuli iliyeka, imtumwa wangu katsohona. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwaapfila nene imwenyegho na imunu yane ukulu, nina asikali iwali hasi hangu. Ning'amlongela yumwe, ‘Ghenda!’ Naye koghenda, na ning'amlongela yungi, ‘Itsa!’ Naye kakutsa, na ning'amlongela imtumwa wangu, ‘Tenda achino!’ Naye kochitenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu hahulike apfo, kakangawala, kawahundukila iwanu iwelongotse naye, kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, sina mbone bae imunu iyotoghola ka imunu yuno, hata mne isi ya Isiraeli!” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Kuya iwanu wala hawoyile ukaye kwe imkulu wa asikali wa Roma wampfika imtumwa yula kahona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komtsilihula imwana we chitsuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Hambele chidogho, Yesu kaghenda mne ghumji ighukemighwe Naini na iwanang'ina wake, aku kelongotsa na iwanu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Kuya hapfikile habehi na libani kulu lye ghumji, kulawila iwanu waghala lukuli lwa msongolo iyapfile, yeye tsamwana nyalimwe wa ipinga iyali chitsuka. Iwanu wengi iwalawile ghumji ghula tsawakala hamwe na ipinga ayo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />IMNDEWA hayamwonile ipinga ayo, kamwonela libatsi, kamlongela, “Uleke kulila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Kuya kaghenda kakinda machela, ne iwanu iwaghalile machela tsawema. Yesu kalonga, “Imsongolo, nokulongela, winuke!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Imsongolo yula iyafile kenuka kandusa ukulonga. Kuya Yesu kamwing'a mai we imsongolo yula.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Iwanu wose wapfuka na wamtunya Imulungu. Walonga, “Nabii mkulu katulawila mghati mwetu. Imulungu katsa kuwapfila iwanu wake.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Mbuli atsino tsa Yesu tsenela mne isi yose ya Yudeya na tsiisi tsose itsili habehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwatumighwa kulawa kwe Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Iwanang'ina wa Yohane wamlongela Yohane agha ghose. Naye kawakema iwanang'ina wake weli <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />kawatuma waghende kwe IMNDEWA wamghutse, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa yuyula yulongighwe na Yohane katsakutsa au tumbete imunu yungi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Hawapfikile kwa Yesu, walonga, “Yohane Mbatitsa katutuma tukughutse, ‘Apfi ghweghwe kwa yuyula yulongighwe na Yohane katsakutsa au tumbete munu yungi?’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Ichipindi chichila, Yesu kawahonetsa iwatamu wengi ng'ani, kawalapfa ipfinyamkela na kawatenda ipfifita wengi wone. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesu kawedika iwanang'ina wa Yohane, “Mghende mkamlongele Yohane aghala ghamwonile na kughahulika; ipfifita sambi wakwona, ipfimbete woghenda, wane ukoma wohona, ipfitsiwi wohulika, iwanu iwafile wotsilihulighwa na mbuli tsinoghile tsopetighwa kwe wahingwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kabweda imunu yula yang'onyihila nene.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Hambele iwasenga wa Yohane hawokile, Yesu kandusa kuwalongela iwanu mbuli tsa Yohane, “Hamghendile kunyika, apfi mghendile kulola choni? Kululola lusinde ppfaluyughisighwa na libeho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Apfi tsamghendile kulola choni? Imunu yapfalile lighwanda linoghile? Iwanu iwopfala ghamaghwanda ghanoghile na wane ughima unoghile wokala mne tsing'anda tse iwandewa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Mnongele, apfi tsamghendile kulola choni? Nabii? Ona, lekeni tsamwona pfinu pfingi kubita nabii. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Kwaapfila Yohane iyo yuyo iyandikighwe mna Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, ‘Imulungu tsakalonga, nitsomtuma imtumighwa wangu akulongole, katsoigholosa nzila yako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Yohane kambala kubita imunu wowose, lekeni imunu wowose yali mdodo mne Undewa wa Imulungu kambala kumbita Yohane.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Iwanu wose, na iwasola kodi, hawahulike agho wamtoghola Imulungu, kwaapfila tsawabatitsighwa na Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Lekeni Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso tsawalema aghala ghayawalaghitse Imulungu watende, kwaapfila ng'awabatitsighwe na Yohane bae.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi iwanu wa mweleko ghuno weghala ne chinu chachi? Weghala na choni? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Weghala ne iwana iwakalile kusoko. Wekema wenyegho kwa wenyegho, ‘Tuwatowela chimbeta, ng'ampfinile bae, tuwembila uwila we usungu, ng'amlilile bae!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yohane Mbatitsa tsakatsa, ng'ajile bae ichijo na ng'anwile bae imbwali, mwemwe mlonga, ‘Yohane kana chinyamkela!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Imwana we imunu katsa, kakuja na kakunwa, namwe mlonga, ‘Imunu yuno kakujisa na kopatika sideke, sale wa iwasola kodi na wane nzambi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Lekeni ihekima yoneka inogha kwe iwanu wose yawaitoghole.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipinga yane nzambi kombaka ghamafuta Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfarisayo yumwe tsakamkema Yesu atse kuja naye ichijo cha nemihe. Yesu kaghenda mne ing'anda ya Mfarisayo ayo, kakala hasi yaje ichijo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mne ghumji ghula, tsakukala ne ipinga yane nzambi. Hayahulike Yesu kakuja mne ing'anda ya Mfarisayo ayo, ipinga ayo katsa na ichupa inoghile imemile ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Kema habehi na ghamaghulu gha Yesu, kolila na ghamasotsi ghake ghamlaghalila Yesu. Kuya kabaghusa ghamaghulu gha Yesu kwa tsimvili tsake, kaghanonela na kabaka ghamafuta aghala, mmaghulu mwa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mfarisayo ayo honile pfino, kelongela imwenyegho, “Imunu yuno ang'awile nabii, ang'amtangile ipinga yuno iyamkindile ka imunu wachi, ang'ammanyile kana nzambi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu kamlongela, “Simoni, nina chinu nobama nikulongele” Simoni kedika, “Ona mlangulitsi, nongele.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu kandusa kulonga, “Tsahana wanu weli iwatsime sendi kwe imunu iyakwatsima iwanu tsisendi. Yumwe katsima elufu tano na yungi katsima hamsini. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Mna wose weli, kuduhu yalihile sendi, apfo imunu iyakwatsima wanu tsisendi kawalekela wose. Apfi mne wano weli yuhi yatsomnoghela ng'ani imunu iyakwatsima iwanu tsisendi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni kamwidika, “Nopfikitsa imunu yula yalekelighwe tsisendi nyingi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kalonga, “Kulonga ghoya.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kuya Yesu kamhundukila ipinga ayo, kamlongela Simoni, “Apfi kwomwona ipinga hayu? Nitsa mng'anda mwako, ng'ungaile bae ghamatsi gha kuhopfugha ghamaghulu ghangu, lekeni ipinga ayu kahopfugha ghamaghulu ghangu kwa ghamasotsi ghake na kaghabaghusa kwa tsimvili tsake. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ng'uninonele bae, lekeni kulawa hayengile ipinga ayu kaghendelela kughanonela ghamaghulu ghangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ng'ubakile bae litwi lyangu ghamafuta, lekeni ipinga ayu kaghabakatsa ghamaghulu ghangu kwa ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Nokulongela, kwaapfila nzambi tsake nyingi tsileghusighwa, apfo kaninoghela ng'ani. Lekeni imunu yalekelighwe chidogho konoghela chidogho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Kuya Yesu kamlongela ipinga ayo, “Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Iwanu wangi iwakalile hala wandusa kwilongela, “Ayu imunu wachi mbaka yaleghuse nzambi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu kamlongela ipinga hayo, “Ukutoghola kwako kukukombola. Ughende tseghamba.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Iwapinga iwelongotse na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Matsuwa ghaghala, Yesu tsakanga mne tsikaye na mna imiji, kuno kowapetela iwanu imbuli inoghile ye undewa we Imulungu. Na wala Iwanang'ina kumi na weli waghenda na Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />naye tsakelongotsa ne iwapinga wangi iwalapfighwe ipfinyamkela na kuhonetsighwa matamu. Iwapinga awo tsawakala Mariya iyakemighwe Magidalena, yalapfighwe ipfinyamkela saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yoana, mwehe wake Kusa, imkulu mne libaratsa lya Herodi, na Susana, na iwapinga wangi wengi. Wawo tsawalapfa pfinu pfawo wamwapfile Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Iwanu wamghendela Yesu kulawa chila kaye, iwanu hawatingane hamwe, Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Imunu tsakaghenda kuhanda tsimbeghu. Hang'ali yomitsa tsimbeghu mne mghunda, tsingi tsilaghalila mnzila. Iwanu watsibayugha na pfideghe watsija. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo lili mbambalawe, hatsotile, tsinyala kwaapfila tsakuduhu ghamatsi mne lidongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Tsingi tsilaghalila mwibagho, tsikula hamwe, na libagho litsikoma tsimbeghu hatso. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Na tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo linoghile, tsikula na kweleka imitama, chila imwe ghana limwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu hayalongile apfi, kakemelela, “Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa Yesu imbuli ino ina mana yachi? <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mtendighwa mmanye mbuli tse undewa we Imulungu. Lekeni kwe iwanu wangi, nolonga kwe tsimbuli, walole lekeni waleke kwona, wategheletse lekeni waleke kumanya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela imbuli ye imunu iyohanda ilonga choni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Aino mana ye imbuli ino. Mbeghu yolangusa imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mnzila tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, lekeni Setani kakutsa na kuisola imbuli kulawa mne imimoyo yawo, ili waleke kutoghola na kukombolighwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo lili mbambalawe tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu na kuibokela kwa kudeng'elela, lekeni ng'aitsama bae mghati mwe imimoyo yawo. Woitoghola kwe ichipindi chidodo, lekeni mne ichipindi cha kughetsighwa na Setani, webaghula. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mwibagho tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu lekeni pfawoghendelela, imbuli ye Imulungu yohinyighwa na maghayo, ndeng'elelo, na tsimali tse isi. Iwanu awo ng'awokweleka ghamatunda ghakomale bae. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Lekeni tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo linoghile tsolangusa iwanu iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woibokela na woitoghola kwe imimoyo yawo na wodudumila mbaka wokweleka ghamatunda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichitasa ichighubikighwe ne chiha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:21-25">Mat 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Iwanu ng'awotuwitsa bae ichitasa na kuchighubika na chiha au kuchika kumpfungu mwe lutsatsi. Lekeni iwanu wochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa ili iwanu iwakwingila wadahe kughona ghumwanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwaapfila ichinu chochose ichipfisighwe chitsakuwa mwatsi, na ichinu chochose ichighubikighwe chitsomanyika na kughalighwa mne ghumwanga.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Apfo mwalangitse pfamuhulikitsa, kwaapfila imunu yenacho katsakongetsighwa, ne imunu yalihela ichinu katsobokighwa hata achila chopfikitsa kenacho.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mai wake Yesu na ndughu tsake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mai wake ne iwandughu tsake Yesu wamtsila, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kupfika habehi naye, kwaapfila iwanu tsawengi sideke. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Imunu yumwe kamlongela Yesu, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wema kunze, wobama wakwone.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu kedika, “Mai wangu na ndughu tsangu, iwo wala iwohulika imbuli ye Imulungu na kuitoghola.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu inyamale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:22-25">Mat 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi ne iwanang'ina wake, kawalongela, “Tuloke kumwambu mwe tsimbu.” Apfo wandusa ghumwanza. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Hawang'ali mne ghumwanza, Yesu kawasa. Bahala, nyahemu ng'ulu ng'ani tsailawila mne tsimbu na mnumbwi wandusa kumema ghamatsi, apfo wose tsawabama watsame. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlamsa, “Mtwatsa, Mtwatsa! Twotsama!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kalamka, kalikembela libeho ne inyahemu, napfo pfinyamala. Litsimbu linyamala tulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Kulikwani ukutoghola kwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Lekeni wakangawala, wapfuka, welongela, “Ayu imunu wachi? Kokembela libeho ne inyahemu, napfo pfomhulikitsa?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yane pfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghendelela na ghumwanza, wapfika mne isi ya Gerasi, ili kumwambu mwe tsimbu Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu hayang'ali yohulumka mne mnumbwi, kaghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu, ketingana ne imunu yane ipfinyamkela. Imunu ayo ng'apfalile bae ghamaghwanda kwa ghamatsuwa mengi, na ng'akalile bae mng'anda, lekeni ang'ali yokala kune tsikaburi. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Hamwonile Yesu, tsakalila na kamghwila mmaghulu, kuya kakemela, “Yesu, Imwana we Imulungu Iyali Kuchanya Ng'ani! Apfi kwobama unitende choni? Nokulomba uleke kunidununza!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Imunu yuno kalonga apfino kwaapfila Yesu tsakawakembela ipfinyamkela wamlawe. Chinyamkela ayo ang'ali yomghoghagha. Hata ka iwanu tsawamwoha ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake ne minyololo, yeye kaibema minyololo ayo, na ipfinyamkela wamghalagha mbaka kunyika. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Taghwa lyako nani?” Naye kamwidika, “Taghwa lyangu ‘Likingili’,” kwaapfila tsakana ipfinyamkela wengi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ipfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu aleke kuwaghala mne lipondo lyang'alitsigha.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Habehi na hanu hala tsahana kingili lye iwangubi iwang'ali wakuja mlughongo. Apfo pfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu awalekelele wawengile iwangubi awo, naye Yesu kawaleka wawengile. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Ipfinyamkela wamlawa imunu ayo wengila mne iwangubi. Likingili lyose lye iwangubi litsumila kulwanda mwe tsimbu Galilaya, wafa mne ghamatsi.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Wadimi we iwangubi hawonile achila ichilawile, watsuma na kutsilonga mbuli atso mne ghumji na mne ipfijiji. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Iwanu waghenda kulola achila ichilawile, hawapfikile kwa Yesu, wampfika imunu yahonetsighwe ipfinyamkela kakala mmaghulu mwa Yesu, kapfala ghamaghwanda, na tsimbutsi tsake tsimuyila keli. Iwanu wose tsawapfuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Iwanu wala iwonile chinu chino wawalongela iwanu apfila imunu yane ipfinyamkela pfayahonetsighwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Kuya iwanu wose we isi ya Gerasi wamlomba Yesu yoke kwaapfila tsawapfuka ghendo. Apfo Yesu kengila mne mnumbwi yoke. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Imunu yahonetsighwe ipfinyamkela kamlomba Yesu, “Leka nighende na ghweghwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Lekeni Yesu ng'atoghole bae kughenda naye, kamlongela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Uye ukaye ukawalongele iwanu achila chayakutendele Imulungu.” Apfo kaghenda muisi mwose, kawalongela iwanu achila Yesu chayamtendele.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Neghe Yairo ne ipinga iyakindile ghwanda lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu hayoile ubali ungi wa tsimbu, iwanu wambokela kwa kudeng'elela kwaapfila wose tsawang'ali wombeta. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Kuya katsa imunu yumwe yakemighwe Yairo, iyakalile mkulu we Ing'anda ya ukulombela. Keghwisa mmaghulu mwa Yesu, kamlomba aghende ukaye yake, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwaapfila imwanaghe ipinga nyalimwe yane miyaka kumi na mili yang'ali yobama yafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda, iwanu wammemela chila hanu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Pinga yumwe yadununzike kwa utamu wa kulawa idamu kwa miyaka kumi na mili, hata ka tsakaghisa mali tsake tsose kwa waghanga, tsakuduhu imunu yadahile kumhonetsa, tsakakala mne iwanu awo. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Pinga ayo tsakatsa kuchisogho kwa Yesu kakinda pindo lya ghwanda lyake. Bahala idamu ileka kumlawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu kaghutsa, “Angu yuhi yanikindile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Iwanu wose wabela. Petiri kalonga, “IMNDEWA, iwanu wakutsunguluka na wakumemela!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Lekeni Yesu kalonga, “Kuna imunu kang'inda, nimanya kwaapfila ngupfu tsangu tsindawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ipinga hayonile ng'odaha bae kwipfisa, tsakatsa aku koghudema, keghwisa mmaghulu mwa Yesu. Kamlongela Yesu hambele he iwanu iwali hala ichinu ichimtendile amkinde na bahala pfayahonetsighwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu kamlongela ipinga ayo, “Mwanangu, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa. Ughende tseghamba.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu hang'ali yolonga, tsakatsa imunu kulawa mne ing'anda ya Yairo. Kamlongela Yairo, “Uleke kumtsupfa Imlangulitsi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Lekeni Yesu haulike apfo kamlongela Yairo, “Uleke kupfuka, ghwe toghola na imwanagho katsohonetsighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Hapfikile ukaye kwa Yairo, kawaghoma iwanu waleke kwingila naye mng'anda, lekeni Petiri, Yohane, Jakobu, aba wa imwana yula iyafile na mai wake. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Wanu wose wang'ali womlila imwana iyafile akuno weyayana. Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kulila, imwana ng'afile bae, ila kawasa!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Iwanu wose wamseka Yesu kwaapfila tsawamanya imwana kafa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu kaghukinda ghumoko ghwe imwana iyafile, kamlongela, “Mwanangu, lamka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Imwana iyafile ughima wake umuyila, na bahala kalamka. Kuya Yesu kawalongela wamwing'e imwana yula ichijo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Aba wake na mai wake tsawakangawala, lekeni Yesu kawaghoma kumlongela imunu wowose achila ichilawile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu tsakawakema hamwe iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kaweng'a ingupfu na uwetso wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela na kuhonetsa watamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kuya kawatuma kuwapetela iwanu mbuli tsa Undewa we Imulungu na kuwahonetsa iwatamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Kawalongela, “Mne ghumwanza mleke kusola ichinu chochose, mleke kusola ng'weku wala ghumkoba wala ichijo wala sendi wala maghwanda meli. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ing'anda yoyose yamkwingila, mkale mmo mbaka hamkuka mne ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Iwanu wang'alema kuwabokela, hamlawa mne ghumji aghwo, mkung'use litimbwisi mmaghulu mwenu, chiwe ichitango ka walema kumuhulikitsani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Iwanang'ina wake waghenda mne ipfijiji pfose, aku wopeta Imbuli Inoghile na wowahonetsa iwanu chila hanu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imndewa Herodi kompfuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Herodi hakalile mndewa wa Galilaya, kahulika ipfinu pfose ipfitendighwe na Yesu. Naye kapfuka kwaapfila iwanu wangi tsawang'ali wolonga Yohane mbatitsa katsilihuka, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />wangi walonga Eliya kalawila, na wangi walonga nabii yumwe wa ghumwande katsilihuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herodi kalonga, “Yohane tsanimghana litwi, apfi ayu nani iyanihulika mbuli tsake?” Naye tsakabama amwone.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Iwatumighwa wake hawoyile wamlongela Yesu chila ichinu chawatendile. Naye kawasola iwanang'ina wake waliyeka, kaghenda nawo mne ghumji ighukemighwe Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Iwanu hawamanyile kwaghendile, tsawamuwinza. Yesu kawabokela, kalonga nawo mbuli tse Undewa we Imulungu na kawahonetsa iwanu iwabamile kuhonetsighwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Litsua haling'ali lyikuswa, iwanang'ina kumi na weli wamghendela Yesu wamlongela, “Walongele iwanu waghende mne ipfijiji na kaye itsili mne imighunda tsa habehi kubama ichijo na hanu ha kuwasa, kwaapfila twakunyika.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lekeni Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe iwenyegho muweng'e ichijo waje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Wamwidika, “Twetwe tuna pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli waliheka. Pfii kwobama tughende tukawaghulile iwanu wose wano?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Hanu hala hana wamale elufu tano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Muwalongele iwanu wakale mne makingili, na chila kingili wanu hamsini.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Kuya iwanang'ina watenda apfo, iwanu wose wakala hasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu kasola pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki. Kuya kamegha pfighate ne iwasomba, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Iwanu wose tsawaja weghuta. Ne iwanang'ina wadondola pfihindi pfe pfighate ne iwasomba ipfimemile Pfiseghe kumi na pfili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kotoghola kwa kulonga ka Yesu ka Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu ang'ali yolomba aliyeka. Iwanang'ina wake wamtsila, naye kawaghutsa, “Apfi iwanu wolonga nene nani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nawo wamwidika, “Iwanu wamwenga wolonga ghweghwe kwa Yohane Mbatitsa, wangi wolonga kwa Eliya, wangi wolonga kwayumwe wa manabii wa ghumwande yoyile mne ughima.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Naye kawaghutsa, “Namwe mwolonga nene nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petiri kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu yulawile kwe Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Kuya Yesu kawakanya waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ichinu chino.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga pfatsodununzika na pfatsakufa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Malk 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">Malk 9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Pfipfila tsakawalongela, “Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yadununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwabala, ipfilongotsi we inambiko ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Katsokomighwa, kuya mne litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Kuya kawalongela wose, “Imunu wowose iyobama kuniwinza nene yeleme imwenyegho na yaghale msalaba ghwake, aniwinze. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake katsowaghitsa, lekeni wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake kwa kuniwinza nene katsoukombola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Apfi imunu yobweda choni ka ang'apata chila chinu ichili muisi mwose, aku kowaghisa ughima wake? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Imunu wowose iyombonela chinyala nene na ghamalangulitso ghangu, Imwana we Imunu katsomwonela chinyala hatsakutsa mne utunitso wake, na mne utunitso wa aba wake, na we malaika wahenzeluka. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nowalongela ghendo, wangi iwemile hano ng'awatsakufa bae mbaka wawone Undewa we Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalamka uhanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Malk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Aghabitile matsuwa manane kulawa halongile ipfinu pfino, Yesu kawasola Petiri, Yohane, na Jakobu, wagheluka kuchidunda kulomba. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Yesu hang'ali yolomba, uhanga wake ughalamka na ghwanda lyake liwa tselu chwee. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Bahala iwanu weli wang'ali wolonga naye. Iwanu awo tsawakala Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />woneka mne utunitso wa kulanga na walonga na Yesu mbuli tsa lifwa lyake ilitsolawila Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petiri na wayaghe tsawawasa ghendo, na hawalamke wona utunitso wa Yesu ne iwanu weli wema naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Iwanu awo hawang'ali wakuka, Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Mtwatsa, pfinogha twetwe tukale hano. Leka tutsenge pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe chako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” Petiri ng'amanyile bae yang'ali yolonga choni.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petiri hang'ali yolonga apfo, liwingu lilawila liwaghubika, ne iwanang'ina wapfuka liwingu pfaliwaghubike. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Litsi lilonga kulawa mne liwingu, “Ayuno mwanangu yanimsaghule, mtegheletseni yeye!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Litsi halinyamale, Yesu tsakakala aliyeka. Iwanang'ina wenyamala na ng'awamlongele imunu wowose bae ichinu chawonile ghamatsuwa agho.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo yane ipfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Malk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Haipfikile nemitondo, Yesu na iwanang'ina wadatu wahulumka kuchidunda, na iwanu wengi wetingana naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Imunu yumwe iyakalile mna mtingano ghula ghwe iwanu kakemelela, “Mlangulitsi! Nokulomba umlole imwanangu, imwanangu nyalimwe! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Ichinyamkela komghogha na komtenda adamilile, komtenda yaghwe chisala na lihofu lomlawa mne mlomo, na ng'omlekelela bae himahima! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Niwalomba iwanang'ina wako wamlapfe ichinyamkela, lekeni ng'awadahile bae.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu kamwidika, “Ka! Pfii mwemwe mweleko ing'aghutoghola na iwaghile! Apfi ng'ale namwe na kuwadudumila mbaka tsuwachi?” Kuya kamlongela imunu ayo, “Nighalile hano imwanagho.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Imsongolo hang'ali yomghendela Yesu, ichinyamkela kamghwisa hasi chisala. Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, kamhonetsa imsongolo ayo na kamuhitsa imsongolo ayo kwa aba wake. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Iwanu wose wakangawala kwa uwetso mkulu we Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu kolonga keli lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Iwanu hawang'ali wokangawala kwa ghose ghayatendile Yesu, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mleke kwisemwa achino chaniwalongela! Imwana we Imunu katsoghalighwa mna ghamoko ghe iwanu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Lekeni iwanang'ina wake ng'awamanyile bae mana ye imbuli ino, kwaapfila ipfisighwa waleke kuimanya; nawo wapfuka kumghutsa Yesu imbuli ino.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi katsokughwa imkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Iwanang'ina wa Yesu wandusa kwihisanya yuhi yatsakuwa imkulu mna wawo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu hamanyile ukwalangula kwawo, kamsola imwana mdodo kamwika habehi naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Imunu wowose iyombokela imwana yuno kwa taghwa lyangu kombokela nene. Ne imunu wowose iyombokela nene, pfipfila kombokela iyanitumile. Kwaapfila imunu wowose yali mdodo mna mwemwe katsakughwa mkulu mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu wowose iyowatoghola kahamwe namwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Malk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohane kamlongela Yesu, “Mtwatsa, tumwona imunu kolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa taghwa lyako na tumghoma kutenda apfo, kwaapfila ng'elongotsagha na twetwe bae”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu kamlongela Yohane ne iwanang'ina wangi, “Mleke kumghoma, kwaapfila imunu wowose iyowatoghola mwemwe kahamwe namwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Samariya wolema kumbokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ghamatsuwa gha Yesu gha kuya kulanga aghapfikile habehi, Yesu kabama aghende Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Kawalongotsa iwatumighwa iwaghendile mne tsikaye tsa Samariya kumwikila ghoya chila ichinu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Lekeni iwanu wa Samariya ng'awambokele bae, kwaapfila tsawamanya koghenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Iwanang'ina wake, Jakobu na Yohane hawonile apfo, wamghutsa Yesu, “Mtwatsa, apfi kwobama twetwe tukeme ghumoto ghuhulumke kulawa kulanga ghuwalakatse wose, ka Eliya pfayatendile?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu kawahundukila kawakembela. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Kuya Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda kuna kaye tsingi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwodaha kumuwinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Hawang'ali mnzila, imunu yumwe kamlongela Yesu, “Nitsokuwinza hanu hohose utsoghenda.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu kamlongela, “Wambwa wa kumuhulo wana tsimango ne iwapfideghe wana pfibali, lekeni Imwana we Imunu kahela hanu ha kuwasitsa litwi lyake na kubwihila.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu kamlongela imunu yungi, “Niwinze!” Lekeni imunu yula kalonga, “IMNDEWA, leka tanu mbuye ukaye nikamtsike aba wangu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu kamwidika, “Leka iwanu iwafile wawatsike wayawo, ila ghweghwe ghenda upete Undewa we Imulungu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Imunu yungi kalonga, “IMNDEWA, nitsokuwinza lekeni leka tanu nikawalongele iwandughu tsangu nakuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu kamlongela, “Imunu wowose iyokwaluka kulima na kuya kolola kuchisogho ng'obamighwa mne Undewa we Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanu sabini na weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawasaghula iwanu wangi sabini na weli na kawatuma weliweli wamlongolele chila kaye na chila hanu abamile kughenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Kawalongela, “Ghamapfuno mengi, lekeni iwosang'ana wadodo. Mumlombe IMNDEWA wa ghamahuno awatume watenda isang'ano mne mghunda ghwake. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Mghende! Nowatuma mwemwe ka iwang'olo mghati mwe wambwa wa kumuhulo. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mleke kusola ghumfuko au ghumkoba au imikwabatsa. Na mleke kulamsa imunu wowose mnzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Na ing'anda yoyose yamtsakwingila, tanu mlonge, ‘Mkale tseghamba mne ing'anda ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ka imunu yobama kukala tseghamba kabaho, katsakuwa tseghamba. Ka kuduhu imunu yobama kukala tseghamba, mwemwe mtsokala tseghamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mkale mne ing'anda hayo, mje na mnwe chochose chamkwing'ighwa; kwaapfila mtenda isang'ano kobamighwa yeng'ighwe sendi tsake. Mkale mne ing'anda iyampfikile na mleke kulawa mne ing'anda ayo na kughenda ing'anda ingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Ka mwakwingila mne ghumji ne iwanu wowabokela, diyeni achila chamtsakwing'ighwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Muwahonetse iwatamu iwali hao muwalongele, ‘Undewa we Imulungu wa habehi yenu.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Lekeni ka mwakwingila mne ghumji ne iwanu wolema kuwabokela, biteni mna nzila tsawo mlonge, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Hata litimbwisi lya ghumji ghwenu ilinanahile mmaghulu mwetu twowakung'usilani mwemwe, chiwe chitango ka mlighitighwa, Lekeni mmanye pfino, Undewa wa Imulungu wa habehi ghendo’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nowalongela ghendo, mne litsuwa lya kuhigha Imulungu katsoghuhigha ng'ani ghumji agho kubita ghumji ghwa Sodoma!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiji iilema kutoghola itsoghaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Ghweghwe Kolasini kutsoghaya! Ghweghwe Betisaida kutsoghaya! Kwaapfila ka ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa ipfitendeke hano pfing'atendeke Tiro na Sidoni, iwanu iwali hala wang'apfalile maghwanda gha ghamaghuniya na wang'abakale lipfu kulangusa waleka nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha Imulungu katsoyonela libatsi imiji ya Tiro na Sidoni kubita mwemwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Naghwe Kaperinaumu! Apfi kutsakwinulighwa mbaka kulanga? Bae! Kutsakwasighwa mbaka kutsimu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Imunu iyowategheletsa mwemwe, konitegheletsa nene; ne imunu iyowalema mwemwe, kondema nene. Ne imunu iyondema nene, komlema yula iyanitumile!”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu sabini na weli wakuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Hambele iwanu wala sabini na weli woya wodeng'elela ng'ani, walonga, “Mtwatsa, kwa taghwa lyako tuwakembela ipfinyamkela nawo watenda ka pfatubamile kutenda!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu kawedika, “Nimwona Setani kaghwa ka lumwesa kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mtegheletse! Niweng'ani ukulu mwemwe, apfo mwodaha kuwabajugha wanzoka ne iwainge; mtsakuwa na ukulu kwa iwehile wenu wose. Kuduhu ichinu chitsowalagha. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lekeni mleke kudeng'elela kwaapfila ipfinyamkela wowapfukani, ila mdeng'elele kwaapfila mataghwa ghenu ghandikighwa kulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodeng'elela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">Mat 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17">Mat 17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Isaa iila Yesu kadeng'elela ng'ani na Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu. Kuya kalonga, “Aba, IMNDEWA wa kulanga ne iisi, nolonga mighede kwaapfila kupfipfisa ipfinu pfino kwe iwanu wane ihekima na iwomanya; na kupfilangusa kwe iwana wadodo! Ona, Aba, apfi pfipfo pfaubamile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Kaghendelela kuwalongela iwanu, “Aba wangu kangaya nene ipfinu pfose. Kuduhu imunu iyommanya Imwana ila Aba, na kuduhu imunu iyommanya Aba ila Imwana, ne iwanu wala iwasaghulighwe kulangusighwa ne Imwana.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Kuya Yesu kawahundukila iwanang'ina wake kalonga nawo waliyeka, “Wabalikiighwa iwanu wala iwakona ipfinu pfamkwona mwemwe! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kwaapfila nowalongela, manabii ne iwandewa wengi tsawabama wone achino chamkona mwemwe, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kwona; na kutegheletsa achino chamtegheletsa, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kutegheletsa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Msamariya yanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mlangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso kema amghetse Yesu, kamghutsa, “Mlangulitsi, apfi nobamighwa nitende choni ili niubokele ughima wa matsuwa ghose?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu kamwidika, “Apfi Ghamalaghitso gholongatse? Apfi kwoghamanyatse?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Mnoghele IMNDEWA Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose, kwa muhe wako ghwose, kwa ngupfu tsako tsose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose; na mnoghele miyagho ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu kamwidika, “Kwidika ghoya. Tenda apfo naghwe kutsakuwa na ughima.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Lekeni imunu ayo kabama kwilangusa kanogha, apfo kamghutsa Yesu, “Yuhi imunu wa habehi yangu?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu kamwidika, “Tsahana imunu yumwe yalawile Yerusalemu koghenda Yeriko. Wabapfi wamghogha, wamwibila ipfinu pfake, wamtowa chidogho yafe. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Baho kalawila mtambika kohulumka mna inzila iila, lekeni hamwonile imunu yula yatowighwe, kabita mmbalimbali. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Pfipfila Mlawi hapfikile na kumwona imunu yatowighwe, naye kabita mmbalimbali. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Lekeni Msamariya yumwe ang'ali yobita inzila iila kampfika imunu yula. Hamwonile, kamwonela libatsi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kamghendela, kambakatsa ghamafuta ne idipfai mne ipfilonda pfake kuya kapfoha kwa pfibwende. Kuya kamwika mne ipunda wake, kamghala mne ing'anda ya kuwasa iwahenza, kamng'otsola. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Litsuwa liwinzile Msamariya yula kamwing'a sendi imunu yane ing'anda, kamlongela, ‘Mlolese imunu yuno. Hanikuya, nitsokuyitsila chochose chutumile.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Mkwonatse, apfi mne iwanu awo wadatu, yuhi imunu wa habehi ne imunu iyatowighwe na wabapfi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Imlangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso kamwidika, “Imunu yula yamwonele libatsi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu kamwidika, “Naghwe ghenda ukatende ka pfatendile Msamariya.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda ukaye kwa Marita na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hawang'ali woghenda, kengila mne ichijiji chimwe. Ipinga yumwe yakemighwe Marita kambokela ukaye yake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ipinga ayo tsakana ndughu yake iyakemighwe Mariya, iyakalile hasi habehi na ghamaghulu ghe IMNDEWA. Naye ang'ali yotegheletsa malangulitso ghake. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Marita ang'ali yoghaya na tsing'onde nyingi. Apfo, kamghendela Yesu, kamghutsa, “IMNDEWA, apfi ng'ukwona bae ndughu yangu kandekela ng'onde tsose nisang'ane nene niliyeka? Mlongele yatse yanyapfile!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Marita! Kwokwalangula no ukughaya kwa ipfinu pfingi, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />lekeni ichinu chimwe chiliheka ichibamighwa, na Mariya kasaghula ichinu ichinoghile, na ng'atsobokighwa bae.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalangulitsa kulomba iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Mat 7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu tsakakala hanu hamwe kolomba. Hayamalitse kulomba, imwanang'ina wake yumwe kamlongela, “IMNDEWA, utulangulitse kulomba ka Yohane pfayawalangulitse iwanang'ina wake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu kawalongela, “Hamlomba, mlonge apfi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Aba wetu, taghwa lyako lienzeluka litogholighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Undewa wako utse.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utwing'e ichijo chetu cha chila litsuwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utuleghusile nzambi tsetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">ka pfatumleghusila chila yumwe yatutendele ghehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Na uleke kutwingitsa mne kughetsighwa.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tulonge yumwe wenu kaghenda mne ing'anda ya sale yake nechilo ne ukulonga, ‘Sale yangu, nokulomba ungaye ichijo, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kwaapfila sale yangu yali mne ghumwanza katsa ukaye yangu, na nene nahela ichijo cha kumwing'a!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Na tulonge sale yako yali mng'anda kokwidika, ‘Leka nibwihile! Libani lihindighwa, nene ne iwanangu tuwasa. Sidaha bae kulamka na kukwing'a ichinu chochose!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nowalongela hata ka ng'atsolamka bae na kukwing'a ichijo kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa sale yake, hambele katsolamka na kukwing'a chila ichinu ichaubamile kwaapfila ng'awonile bae chinyala kughendelela kumlomba.”<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Apfo nowalongela, mlombe namwe mtsakwing'ighwa, mbame namwe mtsopata, mghong'onde libani namwe mtsofughulighwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyolomba katsobokela, ne imunu wowose iyobama katsopata, ne imunu wowose iyoghonga libani katsofughulighwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Aba wachi mna mwemwe iyomwing'a imwanaghe inzoka, ka imwanaghe kamlomba isomba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Au ang'amlomba lifinga, katsomwing'a inge? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Ka mwemwe imwihile, mwomanya kuweng'a ipfinu pfinonoghile iwanenu, apfi Aba wenu yali kulanga ng'atsoweng'a bae Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iwanu wala iwomlomba?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Malk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesu ang'ali yomlapfa ichinyamkela chibubu, na ichinyamkela hayalawile, imunu yula kandusa ukulonga, iwanu wakangawala. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Lekeni iwanu wangi walonga, “Ambe Belisebuli, imkulu we ipfinyamkela iyo iyomwing'a yeye ngupfu tsa kuwalapfa ipfinyamkela!”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Iwanu wangi wabama kumghetsa Yesu, apfo wamlomba Yesu atende chitango kulangusa ka kana ingupfu kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Lekeni Yesu kamanya chawang'ali wakwalangula, apfo kawalongela, “Undewa wowose iwighola wenyegho kwa wenyegho ng'autsakwima bae. Na ing'anda ing'awa na maghomba itsakughwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ka Setani keghola imwenyegho, apfi undewa wake utsakwimatse? Nolonga pfino kwaapfila mwemwe mwolonga nolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa tsingupfu tsa Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ka nene nowalapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tsa Belisebuli, apfi iwanu wenu wowalapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tsa nani? Iwanu wenu wenyegho watsowahigha mwemwe mtotsa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lekeni ka nolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa ngupfu tse Imulungu, lelo undewa we Imulungu uwatsila.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Imunu yane ngupfu hayoikalitsa ing'anda yake kwa mghowa, ipfinu pfake ng'apfisolighwa bae. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Lekeni imunu yungi yane ngupfu kumbita yeye hatsomghendela na kumuhuma, katsomboka mghowa ghwehuwile na kupfighola ipfinu pfambokile.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Imunu wowose ka ng'ali hamwe na nene bae, ayo konibela. Ne imunu wowose yang'onyapfila nene ukukunga, ayo kopwililisa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuya kwe ichinyamkela mne imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Ichinyamkela hayomlawa imunu, koghenda mne isi isakale kubama hanu ho kubwihila. Ka ng'apatile bae hanu ho kubwihila, kelongela imwenyegho, ‘Nitsakuya keli mne ing'anda yangu yaniilekile.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Apfo kakuya keli na kuipfika ing'anda yake itsengighwa pfinoghile. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Kuya koghenda kuwasola ipfinyamkela wangi saba wane ngupfu kubita yeye. Nawo wakutsa kukala mghati mwe imunu ayo. Na ughima we imunu ayo wakuwa wiha kubita aho mwanduso.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukudeng'elela kwo ukweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu hang'ali yolonga ipfinu pfino, ipinga yumwe kulawa mne kingili kamlongela Yesu, “Kabweda ipinga iyakweleke na iyakwong'etse.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Wabweda ghendo iwanu wala iwoitegheletsa Imbuli ye Imulungu na kuikinda.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wobama kwona ichitango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Iwanu hawang'ali wakwongetseka, Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Aghuno mweleko ghwihile, ghwobama ichitango. Ng'amtsakwing'ighwa bae ichitango chochose, ila ichitango chila cha Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kwaapfila ka Yona pfayawile ichitango kwe iwanu wa Ninawi, pfipfila Imwana we Imunu katsakuwa ichitango kwe iwanu wa mweleko ghuno. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, Malikiya wa Seba katsakwima na kuwahigha iwanu wa mweleko uno, kwaapfila yeye tsakalawa mne isi yake kaghenda kutegheletsa ghamahala gha ihekima ghe Mndewa Selemani, na hano hana mkulu kubita Imndewa Selemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mne litsuwa lya kuhigha, iwanu wa Ninawi watsakwima na kuwahigha iwanu wa mweleko ghuno, kwaapfila wawo tsawatsileka nzambi tsawo hawamhulike Yona. Nowalongela ghendo, imunu mkulu kubita Yona kabaha!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichitasa cha lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">Mat 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">Mat 23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kuduhu imunu iyotuwa ichitasa na kuchipfisa au kuchighubika kwa chiha. Lekeni kochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa, ili iwanu iwakwingila mghati wadahe kwona ghumwanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Tsinenge tsako tsaichitasa cha lukuli lwako. Ka tsinenge tsako tsakona, lukuli lwako lwose lwenela ghumwanga. Lekeni ka ng'atsikona bae, pfipfila lukuli lwako lwose lwenela chisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Walangitse ghumwanga ighuli mlukuli mwako, ghuleke kuwa ichisi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Apfo, ka lukuli lwako lwose lwenela ghumwanga, na kuduhu ichisi, lukuli lwose lutsong'ala ghendo ka ichitasa pfachikumwemwesela kwa ghumwanga ghwake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahigha Mafarisayo na iwalangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu hayamalitse kulonga, Mfarisayo yumwe kamlomba Yesu aghende naye ukuja. Apfo Yesu kengila mng'anda, kakala hasi kaja. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mfarisayo ayo kakangawala hayamwonile Yesu kakuja bila kuhopfugha ghamoko ghake. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Mwemwe Mafarisayo mwohopfugha ichikombe ne isahani kwa kunze, lekeni mghati mwenu mmema ukuboka na ukwiha. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwawabotsi! Apfi ayula iyalumbile kunze, si yuyula bae iyalumbile mghati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Lekeni muweng'e wahingwa ipfinu ipfili mghati mwe ipfikombe na tsisahani tsenu, na chila chinu chitsonogha kuna mwemwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Mtsoghaya mwemwe Mafarisayo! Kwaapfila mwomlapfila Imulungu tsaka tse bwasi ne itsimbogha tsose ka mnapfu ne imitsani ingi, lekeni mwoleka kutenda ghanoghile kwe iwanu na mwoleka kumnoghela Imulungu. Mwobamighwa tanu muwe iwanu we haki na iwomnoghela Imulungu, bila kughaleka agho ghangi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Mtsoghaya mwemwe Mafarisayo! Kwaapfila mwonoghela kukala mne ipfighoda pfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela, na kulamsighwa kusoko. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mtsoghoya, kwaapfila mweghala ne tsikabuli ing'atsikonekagha bae, na iwanu wobita mchanya akuno ng'awomanya bae”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mlangulitsi yumwe wa Ghamalaghitso kalonga, “Mlangulitsi, pfulonga pfino pfipfila kwotuligha na twetwe!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu kamwidika, “Pfipfila mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso mtsoghaya! Kwaapfila mwowatwika iwanu imitsigho mitito ng'ani, nayo ng'aidutika bae. Na mwemwe wenyegho ng'amuikinda bae hata kwa kugholosa chidole chimwe cha pfidole pfenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mtsoghaya kwaapfila mwowatsengela tsikabuli manabii wala iwakomighwe ne iwabala wenu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Mwemwe wenyegho mwotoghola aghala ghawatendile iwabala wenu, tsawawakoma manabii, namwe mwowatsengela tsikabuli tsawo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Apfo, Hekima ye Imulungu tsailonga, ‘Nitsowatuma manabii ne iwatumighwa, wangi watsokomighwa na wangi watsowingighwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Apfo mweleko ghuno ghutsohighighwa kwa kuwakoma manabii wose kulawa isi hailumbighwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kulawa kukomighwa kwa Abeli mbaka kukomighwa kwa Sakariya, iyakomighwe mghati mwe hanu he ukulapfila inambiko na hanu henzeluke. Ona, nowalongela lukolo luno lutsohighighwa kwa kuwakoma awo wose!”<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Mtsoghoya mwemwe yamlangulitsa Ghamalaghitso! Kwaapfila mpfisa ufughulo wa libani lye ing'anda ya kumanyila. Namwe iwenyegho ng'amwingile bae, na mwowakima iwanu wala iwang'ali wakwingila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu hayokile hanu hala, Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wandusa kumghobola kwa kumghutsa ipfinu pfingi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />wabama wamghoghe kwa ichinu chochose chatsolonga.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kokembela ung'enye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Iwanu wengi tsawetingana mbaka wang'ali webajugha, tanu Yesu kandusa kulonga ne iwanang'ina wake, “Mwalangitse ne hamila ya Mafarisayo ya ung'enye. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Chochose ichighubikighwe chitsoghubulighwa, na chochose ichifisighwe chitsomanyika. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Chochose chamlongile mchisi chitsohulikighwa mne ghumwanga, na chochose chamwinong'onetse mng'anda, chitsolongighwa mwatsimwatsi mchiswili.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi wa kumpfuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nowalongela sale tsangu, mleke kuwapfuka iwanu wala iwolukoma lukuli, lekeni ng'awodaha bae kutenda ichinu chochose chihile. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Nitsowalangusa yuhi wa kumpfuka. Mumpfuke Imulungu, hayomalitsa kukoma kodaha kumwasa imunu jehanamu. Nowalongela, mumpfuke yeye!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Apfi pfideghe watano ng'awoghulighwa bae kwa sendi mbili? Lekeni kuduhu yumwe wao yosemwighwa ne Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Hata tsimvili tsili mne mwitwi mwenu tsipetighwa. Mleke kupfuka kwaapfila mwemwe mnogha ng'ani kubita iwapfideghe wengi!”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola na kumlema Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:19-20">Malk 10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyonitoghola nene hambele he wanu, Imwana we Imunu naye katsomtoghola hambele he malaika we Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Lekeni imunu iyondema nene hambele he iwanu, naye Imwana we Imunu katsomlema hambele he malaika we Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Imunu wowose iyomlonga pfihile Imwana we Imunu katsolekelelighwa, lekeni imunu wowose iyomligha Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ng'atsolekelelighwa bae. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Hamtsoghalighwa mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela, kwe iwatawala ne kwe iwakulu, mleke kupfuka chokulonga na chakwidika. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwaapfila Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu katsowalangulitsa chambamighwa kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya tajiri mbotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Imunu yumwe kulawa mne iwanu iwemile hala kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, mlongele ndughu yangu twigholele ipfinu pfatuleke aba wetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu kamwidika, “Sale yangu, angu yuhi yanyikile nene niwe mlamutsi au niwe mghola pfinu pfenu?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela wose, “Mwalangitse ne ubwa! Kwaapfila ughima we imunu ng'aulawa bae mna pfinu pfingi pfali napfo!”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino; “Tsahana imunu yumwe tajiri tsa yane na mghunda ghunoghile ghumwelekele pfijo pfingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Apfo kefikitsa mmoyo mwake, ‘Nahela hanu ha kwikila pfijo pfangu. Lelo nitendatse?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Kalonga, ‘Nitsotenda apfino; nitsotsimwagha kano tsangu na kutsenga tsingi ng'ulu ng'ani. Amo nitsakwika imitama yangu ne ipfinu pfangu pfingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kuya nitselongela mwenyegho; 'Ghwe ghumoyo ghwangu! Kwinapfo ipfinu pfingi kwa miyaka mingi. Bwihila ghwe; uje, unwe na udeng'elele!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela imunu tajiri, ‘Kwambotsi ghweghwe! Chilo chichino ughima wako utsobamighwa! Pfinu pfawikile pfitsakuwa pfa nani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu kalonga, “Apfi pfipfo pfapfitsakuwa kwe imunu wowose yeikile utajiri imwenyegho, lekeni ng'akwika bae utajiri kwe Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Mleke kughaya na ukwalangula kwe ichijo chambama ili mkale waghima, au ghamaghwanda ghambama kwa ng'uli tsenu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwaapfila ughima unogha kubita ichijo na lukuli lunogha kubita maghwanda. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mlole iwabondwa; ng'awahanda bae wala, ng'awopfuna bae, wala wahela kano, lekeni Imulungu kowang'itsa! Mwemwe mnogha ng'ani kubita wapfideghe! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Apfi yuhi mna mwemwe kwa kwidununza kodaha kwongetsa litsuwa limwe mne ughima wake? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Ka ng'amdaha bae kutenda chinu chidodo ka chino, ebali mwopfidununzikila pfinu pfingi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mlole ghamaluwa pfaghokula; ng'aghosang'ana bae wala ng'aghefoghosa bae. Lekeni nowalongela hata mndewa Selemani na tsimali tsake tsose ng'apfalile bae pfinoghile ka luwa limwe mne ghamaluwa ghano. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ka Imulungu koipfatsa imitsani ya kumghunda leloli lya baha, na ilupfi lyakwasighwa mmoto, apfi ng'atsowatendela mengi bae? Pfii mwemwe yamtoghola chidogho!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Mleke ukwalangula mtsakuja choni au mtsakunwa choni. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kwaapfila iwanu yang'awammanyile Imulungu wopfihamela ipfinu apfo. Na Aba wenu iyali kulanga komanya ipfinu pfambama. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Lekeni muubame undewa wake ne ipfinu pfino mtsakwing'ighwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utajiri wa kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mwemwe wanang'ina wangu, mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila Aba wenu kanoghelwa kuweng'ani undewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Muutse ipfinu pfenu muweng'e tsisendi iwahingwa. Mwitendele imikoba yang'ailalagha bae, na mwike utajiri wenu kulanga, hanu hang'autsohunguka bae. Aho haduhu mbapfi iyodaha kwiba na haduhu mswa iyodaha kuuhinya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwaapfila hane utajiri wako, ghumoyo ghwako ghutsakuwa baho.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleni ghoya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Mwohe misipi mne pfuno pfenu, ne ipfitasa pfenu pfiwe pfakwaka. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Muwe ka watumwa iwombeta imkulu wawo iyakuya kulawa kune ichihungo cha kukwela. Hakuya na kugong'onda libani, baho wompfughulila. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Wabweda iwatumwa wala imkulu wawo hakuya kowapfika wameso. Nowalongela ghendo, imkulu ayo katseyoha msipi mchuno, katsokala nawo mchijo na kuwasang'anila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Itsakuwa ghoya kwe iwatumwa wala imtwatsa wawo ka katsowapfika weyandaa, hata ang'oya nechilo ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Lekeni mmanye apfino; Ka imunu yane ing'anda ang'amanyile lisaa atsakutsa mbapfi, ang'akalile meso. Wala tsang'oileka bae ing'anda yake ibenighwe ne mbapfi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Pfipfila namwe mwobamighwa mwiyandae, kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu katsakutsa lisaa mwemwe ng'amumbetela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imtumwa iyohulika ne ing'ahulika bae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petiri kamghutsa, “IMNDEWA, apfi kwotulongela twetwe tuliyeka imbuli ino au kowalongela iwanu wose?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Apfi yuhi imtumwa mwenyepfale na yane ihekima? Imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake yamwikile kuwatawala iwatumwa wangi, na kuweng'a ichijo chawo mne ichipindi chinoghile. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Itsakuwa ghoya kwe imtumwa yula imtwatsa wake hayatsokuya katsompfika kotenda apfo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nowalongela ghendo, imkulu ayo katsomwika imtumwa yula kupfitawala ipfinu pfake pfose. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Lekeni imtumwa yula ang'elongela imwenyegho, ‘IMNDEWA wangu ng'atsakuya sambi bae’ kuya kakwandusa kuwatowa iwatumwa wose iwamale ne iwapinga, naye kakuja na ukunwa mbaka kopatika. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />IMNDEWA we imtumwa yula katsakutsa mne litsuwa lila imtumwa ayo ng'olimanya bae na mne saa lila ng'alilolele bae, na mkulu ayo katsomghana imtumwa wake mne pfihindi pfili na kumwika hane iwanu iwalemile kutoghola.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Na imtumwa yula iyomanya aghala ghayobama imtwatsa wake aghatende, lekeni ng'okala ghoya bae wala ng'oghatenda bae, imtumwa ayo katsotohighwa ng'ani. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Lekeni imtumwa yula ng'amanyile bae ipfinu pfayabamighwe ne imkulu wake apfitende, naye katenda pfihile, imtumwa ayo katsotowighwa chidogho. Imunu wowose iyeng'ighwe pfingi, kuna yeye pfitsobamighwa pfingi. Na kwe imunu wowose iyeng'ighwe pfingi ng'ani pfitsobamighwa pfingi ng'ani kuna yeye.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatenda iwanu webaghule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Nitsa ukwasa ghumoto muisi, na tsanibama ma ghuwe ghutuwitsighwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ninawo ubatitso wa maghayo nobamighwa niubokele, na nene noghaya ng'ani mbaka umale! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Apfi mwopfikitsa nitsa kuitenda iisi ikale tseghamba? Bae! Sitsile kuwatenda iwanu wakale tseghamba, ila kuwaghola iwanu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kulawa sambi iwanu watano wali mne kaye imwe watsesonga, wadatu kwa weli na weli kwa wadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tsina tate watsesonga ne iwana wawo, ne iwana watsesonga na aba tsawo. Tsina mai watsesonga ne iwana wawo ne iwana watsesonga na mai tsawo. Mai wakwe watsesonga na wakamwana wawo, na wakamwana watsesonga na wakwe tsawo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsimanya tsinyakati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu kawalongela iwanu, “Hamkwona liwingu lyakutsa ubali ukuswela litsuwa, baho mwolonga, imvula itsotowa, na kuya imvula yotowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Na hamkwona libeho kulawa ubali wa kuhisi, mwolonga, ‘Kutsakuwa na lijoto,’ na yakuwa pfipfo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwawang'enye! Mwodaha kulola muisi na mlanga na kulonga imvula itsotowa au litsuwa litsakwalika. Pfii ng'amdaha bae kughamanya matsuwa ghano gha sambi?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wighongole ne mwihile wako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Ebali mwemwe iwenyegho ng'amdaha bae kwilamlila chinu chihi ichinoghile? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ka imunu yane lighomba naghwe kokughala mne ing'anda ya kuhighila. Mnzila utende pfaudaha wighongole naye ng'ana wingile mne libalatsa. Ka si pfipfo bae, mlamutsi katsokughala kwa asikali, na asikali watsokwika mchifungo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nokulongela, ng'autsolawa bae mbaka ulapfe sendi yako ya mwisho!”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mleke tsinzambi hela mtsakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ichipindi chichila tsahana iwanu iwampetele Yesu mbuli tsa Wagalilaya iwakomighwe na Pilato hawang'ali womlapfila Imulungu inambiko. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi mwemwe mwopfikitsa Wagalilaya wala tsawana nzambi kubita Wagalilaya wangi kwaapfila tsawadununzika pfino? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Bae! Nowalongela ka ng'amtsileka nzambi tsenu, pfipfila namwe mwose mtsakufa ka pfawapfile wao. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Kuya pfii iwanu wala kumi na wanane iwafile kwa chilingilo ichiwaghwile ako Siloamu? Apfi mwopfikitsa iwanu wala wakala na nzambi kubita iwanu wangi iwokala Yerusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Bae! Nowalongela ka ng'amtsileka nzambi tsenu, pfipfila namwe wose mtsakufa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mtini ing'aghukweleka ghamatunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino, “Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe yane mbiki wa matunda mne mghunda wake wa mitsabibu. Kaghenda kubama litunda mne mbiki awo, lekeni ng'apatile bae. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Apfo kamlongela mkalitsi wa mghunda aghwo, ‘Lola, kwa miyaka midatu tsaning'ali nikutsa hano kubama matunda mne mbiki ghuno, sipatile chinu bae. Ghughane! Ebali ghughendelele kulihinya lidongo?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Lekeni mkalitsi wa mghunda kamwidika, ‘IMNDEWA, ghuleke kwa ghumwaka ghuno ghumwe, na nene nitsoghuhimbila na kughwikila imboleya. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Kuya ghung'eleka ghamatunda itsakuwa ghoya! Lekeni ka ng'aghutsakweleka, kutsoghughana.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ipinga mna Litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mna Litsuwa lya Sabato Yesu ang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ya ukulombela. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Baho tsahana ipinga yumwe yane ichinyamkela iyamtendile yaghule kwa miyaka kumi na nane. Tsakapfeduka na ng'adahile bae kwigholosa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu hamwonile, kamkema, kamlongela, “Mai kuhonetsighwa utamu wako!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kuya Yesu kamwikila ghamoko ipinga ayo, bahala kagholoka na kamtunya Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela tsakona maya kwaapfila Yesu kamhonetsa mai ayo mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, apfo kawalongela iwanu, “Mwinagho ghamatsuwa sita gha kusang'ana. Mtse mna ghamatsuwa agho mhonetsighwe, mleke kutsa mne Litsuwa lya Sabato!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />IMNDEWA kedika, “Mwa wang'enye! Apfi yumwe wenu ng'odaha bae kumdohola ing'ombe au ipunda wake kulawa hanu ha ukujila mne Litsuwa lya Sabato na kumlongotsa aghende kunwa ghamatsi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ipinga yuno kaimwana wa Abrahamu, iyaghoghighwe na Setani kwa miyaka kumi na nane. Lelo pfii ng'apfinoghile bae kumdohola mne Litsuwa lya Sabato?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Yesu halongile apfi, iwehile wake tsawona chinyala, lekeni iwanu tsawang'ali wodeng'elela kwa ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa ipfitendighwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat 13:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi Undewa we Imulungu wighala na choni? Apfi nitumile imbuli yachi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Wighala ne imbeghu ndodo ya haladali iyaisolile imunu yumwe na kuihanda kumghunda. Imbeghu ila ikula na kuwa mbiki mkulu, na iwapfideghe watsenga ipfibali mna ghamaputila ghake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu kawaghutsa keli, “Apfi nitumile imbuli yachi mmanye Undewa we Imulungu? Wighalile na choni? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Wighala ne hamila iyaisolile ipinga yumwe na kaitipfa ne usaghe mwingi na usaghe wose usasuka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libani lisisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Kuya Yesu kaghendelela na ghumwanza ghwake kughenda Yerusalemu. Hayang'ali mnzila, kabitila mne imiji ne ipfijiji, kawalangulitsa iwanu ako. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Imunu yumwe kamghutsa Yesu, “Mtwatsa, apfi watsokombolighwa iwanu chidodo waliyeka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu kawedika, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mtende pfamdaha kwingila mng'anda kubitila mne libani lisisili, kwaapfila iwanu wengi watsobama kwingila mng'anda lekeni ng'awatsodaha bae. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Imunu yane ing'anda katsakwima na kulihinda libani. Namwe mtsakwima kunze na ukwandusa kughong'onda libani na ukulonga, ‘IMNDEWA tupfughulile.’ Lekeni yeye katsowedika, ‘Siwamanyile bae kwamlawa kwani!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Kuya mtsomwidika, ‘Twetwe twa awala yatujile na ukunwa naghwe, na tsakutulangulitsa mne isi yetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Lekeni katsolonga keli, ‘Siwamanyile bae kwamlawa kwani. Laweni hano, mwemwe mwose yamtendile ghehile!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Mtsolila na kugheghedula ghamatsino hamtsomwona Abrahamu, Isaka, Yakobu ne manabii wose wamne undewa we Imulungu, lekeni mwemwe mwasighwa kunze! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Iwanu watsakutsa kulawa ubali wa kwalilawila litsua ne ubali wa kwalikuswela litsuwa, na kulawa ubali wa kuchanya na kuhisi, watsokala mne chihungo wakuja mne undewa we Imulungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Kuya iwanu iwawile wa usighilo watsakuwa wa mwanduso, ne iwanu iwawile wa mwanduso watsakuwa wa usighilo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koyonela libatsi Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Matsuwa ghaghala Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela Yesu, wamlongela, “Ughende hanu hangi kwaapfila Herodi kobama akukome.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu kawedika, “Mghende mumlongele ayu yumbwa wa kumuhulo, ‘Leloli na ilupfi nolapfa ipfinyamkela na kuwahonetsa iwanu, na mne litsuwa lya kadatu nitsomalitsa isang'ano yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Hata apfo, nobamighwa leloli na ilupfi na ikacha nighendelele na ghumwanza ghwangu kwaapfila ng'apfinoghile bae nabii kukomighwa kunze kwa Yerusalemu!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Ghwe Yerusalemu! Ghwe Yerusalemu! Kwowakoma manabii na kuwatowa kwa ghamabwe iwatumwa we Imulungu iwatumighwe kuna ghweghwe! Mara nyingi tsambama kuwakunga iwanagho ka ng'uku pfowaghubika pfitsiya wake kwa ghamabawa ghake, lekeni ghweghwe ng'aubamile bae! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Mlole, mlekelighwa ing'anda yenu. Nowalongela, ng'amtsombona keli bae mbaka mlonge, ‘Kabalikiighwa ayula iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu imtamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Litsuwa limwe lya Sabato, Yesu tsakaghenda kuja mne ing'anda ye imkulu wa Mafarisayo. Iwanu wang'ali wamlolesa ng'ani Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Imunu yapfimbile lukuli kaghenda hambele ha Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu kawaghutsa iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na Mafarisayo, “Apfi pfinogha kumhonetsa imunu mne Litsuwa lya Sabato au ng'apfinoghile bae?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Lekeni ng'awalongile chinu bae. Apfo Yesu kamkinda imtamu ayo, kamhonetsa, kamleka yoke. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Ka yumwe wenu kana imwana au ing'ombe kaghwila mchisima mne Litsuwa lya Sabato, apfi ng'odaha bae kumkwegha alawe kunze?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Lekeni ng'awadahile bae kumwidika.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhola na uluso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu halolile iwahenza wangi pfawang'ali wosaghula ipfighoda ipfili hambele, kawalongelela wose imbuli ino, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Ka imunu kakulongela utse mne ichihungo cha kukwela, uleke kukala mne ipfighoda pfa hambele. Kwaapfila imunu yungi mkulu kubita ghweghwe kodaha kutsa, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />ne imunu iyawakemile wose mtse katsokutsila na kukulongela, ‘Winuke akale yuno.’ Kuya kutsakona ichinyala na kughenda kukala mne ipfighoda ipfili kuchughu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Lekeni ghweghwe utende apfi, haupfika mne chihungo, ughende kukala mne ipfighoda ipfili kuchughu, ili mwenyekaye hatsakutsa yakulongele, ‘Sale yangu, winuke, utse ukale mne ipfighoda ipfili hambele.’ Kuya kutsotogholighwa ne iwanu wose iwakalile naghwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwaapfila imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mkulu katsotendighwa mdodo, ne imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mdodo katsotendighwa mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Kuya Yesu kamlongela imunu yula iyamlongele atse, “Ka kwowatendela iwanu ichihungo, uleke kuwakema sale tsako au iwandughu tsako au iwanu matajiri iwali habehi naghwe. Ung'atenda apfi, nawo watsokukema ughende mmakaye mwawo, apfo watsokuliha ka ghweghwe pfauwatendele. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Lekeni ka kwotenda ichihungo, uwakeme wahingwa, pfimbete, iwanu waholole, na pfifita, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />naghwe kutsobalikiighwa, kwaapfila ng'awatsodaha bae kukuliha. Imulungu katsokuliha mne litsuwa lya kutsilihulighwa iwanu iwanoghile.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ichihungo chikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Imunu yumwe iyakalile na Yesu haulike apfi, kamlongela Yesu, “Kabweda ghendo imunu yula yatsakuja ichijo che chihungo mne Undewa we Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu kamwidika, “Imunu yumwe tsayang'ali yotenda chihungo chikulu, kawakema iwahenza wengi watse. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ichihungo hachipfikile, imunu yula kamtuma imtumwa wake kuwalongela iwanu iyawakemile watse, ‘Mtse, kwaapfila sambi chila ichinu chitandighwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Lekeni wose walema kupfika kwaapfila chila imunu tsakakala ne isang'ano yake. Imunu wa mwanduso kamlongela imtumwa ayo, ‘Nighula mghunda nobama nighende nikaghukaghule, Sikutsa bae.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Imunu yungi kalonga, ‘Nighula iwang'ombe kumi, sambi noghenda kuwaghetsa. Sikutsa bae.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Pfipfila imunu yungi naye kalonga, ‘Nikwela sambi, apfo sidaha kutsa bae.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Imtumwa yula koya ukaye kamlongela imtwatsa wake mbuli tsose. Hahulike apfo, yane kaye kaghudubuka kamlongela imtumwa wake, ‘Ghenda himahima mne ipfijiji ne kaye uwalongele wahingwa, iwanu iwaholole, pfifita na pfimbete watse.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Imtumwa ayo kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa, tsanenda ka pfaulaghitse, lekeni hanu ha kukala iwanu hang'ali habaho.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Apfo imtwatsa kamlongela imtumwa wake, ‘Ghenda mne tsinzila na mne ipfijiji uwalongele iwanu watse, ng'anda yangu imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nowalongela, mne iwanu wose yaniwakemile watse, kuduhu hata yumwe yatsolanza ichijo che ichihungo changu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughanzika kwa kuwa imwanang'ina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Baho iwanu wengi tawelongotsa na Yesu, naye Yesu kawahundukila kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Ka imunu wowose konitsila na ng'omhila bae aba wake na mai wake, mwehe wake ne iwanaghe, iwandughu tsake na lumbu tsake na ng'ouhila bae ughima ghwake, ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Na imunu wowose yang'oduta msalaba ghwake na kuniwinza nene, ayo ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Ka yumwe wenu kobama atsenge chilingilo, tanu kokala hasi kopeta sendi tsenatso, kulola kana sendi tsa kumalitsila isang'ano. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kwaapfila ka kandusa kutsenga ghumsingi, na ng'odaha bae kughumalitsila, iwanu wose iwolola chatendile watsomseka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Kuya watsolonga, ‘Imunu yuno kandusa kutsenga lekeni ng'adahile bae kumalitsa isang'ano.’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Ka mndewa koghenda ne iwanu miya imwe kwitowa na mndewa yungi yane iwanu elufu ishirini tanu katsokala hasi na ukwalangula ka kodaha kwitowa ne mndewa ayo. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ka ng'odaha bae, katsowatuma iwatumwa wake waghende kwa mndewa ayo hang'ali kutali wamlombe waleke kwitowa. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Pfipfila ka imunu ng'odaha bae kuleka chila chinu chenacho ng'odaha bae kuwa mwanang'ina wangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunyu ilihela isang'ano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Imunyu inogha, lekeni ka ihinyika, apfi utsoitendatse inoghe keli? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ng'ainogha bae kuika mne mghunda wala kuitipfa ne imboleya, itsakwasighwa. Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gho kuhulika, yahulike!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ing'olo yaghile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Litsuwa limwe iwasola kodi na wane nzambi wamghendela Yesu kumhulikitsa. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Lekeni Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wandusa kwilongela, “Imunu yuno kawabokelagha iwanu wane nzambi na kuja nawo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Imunu wachi mna mwemwe yane iwang'olo miya imwe na ng'olo wake yumwe ang'agha, apfi ng'atsowaleka bae wala tisini na tisa akula koyodimila na kughenda kumbama yula yaghile mbaka amwone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Na hayomwona katsodeng'elela na kumwika mmahegha mwake, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na kumghala ukaye. Kuya katsowakema sale tsake ne iwanu iwali habehi naye na kulonga, ‘Mdeng'e na nene, kwaapfila nimwona ing'olo wangu yaghile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Pfipfila nowalongela kutsakuwa na ndeng'elo ng'ulu kulanga kwe imunu yumwe yane nzambi kutsileka nzambi tsake kubita iwanu wala tisini na tisa iwebona wanogha aku ng'awobama bae kutsileka nzambi tsawo.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya sendi yaghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Au ka ipinga kana sendi kumi, na sendi imwe yagha. Apfi ng'atsotuwa bae ichitasa, na kusegha ing'anda yake na kuibama chila hanu mbaka ayone? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Na hayatsoyona sendi ila, katsowakema sale tsake ne iwanu iwali habehi naye na kuwalongela, ‘Mdeng'e na nene kwaapfila niyona sendi yangu yaghile!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Pfipfila nowalongela, malaika we Imulungu watsodeng'elela kwe imunu yumwe yane nzambi kutsileka nzambi tsake.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imwana iyaghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela, “Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe yawile ne iwana weli. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Imwana mdodo kamlongela aba wake, ‘Aba, ungolele pfinu pfutsongaya.’ Apfo aba kawagholela ipfinu pfake. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ghamatsuwa chidogho hambele, imwana mdodo kautsa ipfinu pfake. Kuya koka ukaye yawo, kaghenda isi ya kutali, ako katsipwilisa sendi tsake kwa pfinu pfihile. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Sendi tsake hatsimalile, inzala ng'ulu ilawila mna isi ila yose, naye kakala kahela ichinu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Apfo kaghenda kulomba isang'ano kwe imunu we isi ila, imunu yula kamlaghitsa aghende mne mghunda ghwake akadime wangubi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Tsakasulukila kuja imibangu yawajile iwangubi, lekeni kuduhu imunu yamwing'ile ichijo. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Tsimbutsi tsake hatsimuyile, keghutsa imwenyegho, ‘Aba wangu kana iwanu wengi we isang'ano iwakuja na kuleka ichijo, na nene nahano noghanzika kwe inzala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Nitsakwinuka na kuya kwa aba wangu na kumlongela, Aba, nimtendela Imulungu nzambi, na pfipfila nikutendela ghweghwe nzambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Sibamighwa bae kukemighwa imwanagho, unende niwe ka yumwe we iwanu wako we isang'ano.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Apfo kenuka koya kwa aba wake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Lekeni hang'ali kakutali, aba wake kamwona kamwonela libatsi; kamtsumila imwanaghe, kamkumbatila, na kamnonela.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />“Imwana kamlongela aba wake, ‘Aba wangu, nimtendela nzambi Imulungu na ghweghwe pfipfila. Sibamighwa bae kukemighwa mwanagho.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Lekeni aba wake kawakema iwatumwa wake kawalongela, ‘Himahima! Mghalileni gholole linoghile mumpfatse. Na ipete mna ichidole chake ne imikwabatsa mmaghulu mwake. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Mumghale imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe. Leka tutende ichihungo na tudeng'elele. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwaapfila imwanangu tsakafa, lekeni sambi kamghima, tsakagha, lekeni sambi koneka.’ Apfo wandusa kudeng'elela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Ichihungo haching'ali chighendelela, imwanaghe mbala tsaka kumghunda. Hapfikile habehi ne ing'anda, kahulika tsingoma ne iwanu wobigha. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Apfo kamkema imtumwa yumwe, kamghutsa, ‘Angu hano hana choni?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Imtumwa ayo kamwidika, ‘Mdodo wako koya ukaye aba wako kamkomela imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe kwaapfila koya mghima!’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Imwana imbala kaghudubuka, kalema kwingila mng'anda. Apfo Aba wake kalawa kunze kamlomba engile mng'anda. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Lekeni kamwidika aba wake, ‘Lola, nikusang'anila miyaka yose ino na silemile bae aghala ghaundaghitse nitenda. Lekeni ng'ungaile bae hata imwana we imene nideng'elele sale tsangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Lekeni imwanagho ayu kahondola mali tsako na mapinga pfiweghe, na hoile ghweghwe kumkomela imwana we ing'ombe yanenehe!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Aba wake kamwidika, ‘Mwanangu, matsuwa ghose ghweghwe kwa hamwe na nene, ne ipfinu pfose pfaninapfo pfako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Lekeni twobamighwa tudeng'elele na kusekelela, kwaapfila mdodo wako tsakafa, lekeni sambi kamghima; tsakagha, lekeni sambi koneka’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mwimilitsi iyakengele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tsahana imunu yumwe yane mali nyingi, naye tsakana mtunza mali wake. Imunu ayo tsakahulika ka mtunza mali wake kapwililitsa mali tsake hela. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Apfo kamkema mng'anda kamghutsa, ‘Angu mbuli tsachi tsanihulike tsikulonga ghweghwe? Nipetele ipfinu pfose pfubokele na pfulapfile, kwaapfila ng'udaha bae kuwa keli mtunza mali wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mtunza mali kelongela mmoyo, ‘Mtwatsa wangu katsoniwinga mne isang'ano. Apfi nitsotendatse? Nahela ingupfu ya kulima, na nakwona chinyala kulomba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Sambi nomanya chinu chachi chanitsotenda ili hanitsowingighwa mne isang'ano yangu, iwanu wanibokele mmakaye mwawo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Apfo kawakema iwanu wose iwodahighwa na imtwatsa wake. Kamghutsa ayula yalongole kutsa, ‘Apfi, mtwatsa wangu yokudahi sendi ngapi?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Kamwidika, ‘Pfiya miya imwe pfa ghamafuta gha tsaituni.’ Mtunza mali ayo kamlongela, ‘Sola cheti chako, kala hasi, wandike pfiya hamsini.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kuya kamghutsa imunu wa keli, ‘Naghwe, udahighwa choni?’ Kamwidika, ‘Maghuniya elufu imwe gha ngano.’ Mwimilitsi kamlongela, ‘Sola cheti chako wandike maghuniya miya nane.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“IMNDEWA kamtunya mtunza mali yula yehile kwaapfila katenda ipfinu kwa kukengela. Kwaapfila iwanu iwali mne isi ino wakengela mna kutenda ipfinu pfawo kubita iwanu iwali mne ghumwanga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />“Nowalongela, mtsitendele tsimali itsili muisi kwipatila sale tsenu wenyegho, ili hatsitsomala, mbokelighwe nawo mne chibumbulika cha ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Imunu wowose iyotogholighwa mne ichinu chidodo katsotogholighwa mne ichinu chikulu, ne imunu wowose yang'atogholighwa mne ichinu chidodo pfipfila ng'atsotogholighwa bae mne ichinu ichikulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kuya ka ng'amtogholighwe bae kwika tsimali tsili mne isi, apfi yuhi iyatsowatoghola kwika tsimali tsa kweli? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ka ng'amtogholighwe bae mna tsimali tse imunu yungi, yuhi yatsoweng'a mwemwe tsimali tsenu iwenyegho?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Kuduhu imtumwa iyodaha kuwasang'anila iwatwa weli. Kwaapfila katsomwihila yumwe na kumnoghela yungi; katsolunga na yumwe na kumbetsa yungi. Ng'amdaha bae kumtumikila Imulungu na sendi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli tsingi tsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13">Mat 13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Mat 5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Malk 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12">Mat 12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mafarisayo iwonoghela tsisendi hawahulike apfo, tsawambetsa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwelangusa kwe iwanu mnogha, lekeni Imulungu koimanya imimoyo yenu. Kwaapfila ichinu ichikwoneka chinogha kwe iwanu, kwe Imulungu chakoneka chiha.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na mbuli tsa manabii tsipetighwa mbaka mne ichipindi cha Yohane Mbatitsa. Kulawa ichipindi acho, mbuli tsinoghile tse Undewa we Imulungu tsipetighwa, na chila imunu kakwingila kwe ingupfu. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Pfibewe kwe ililanga ne isi ukwagha, kubita kuhunguka ichinu chidodo mne Ghamalaghitso.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Immale wowose iyomleka mwehe wake na kumkwela ipinga yungi kotenda utsinzi, ne immale iyomkwela ipinga iyalekighwe kotenda utsinzi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri na Lazali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Tsahana imunu yumwe tajiri yang'ali yopfala maghwanda gha tsambalau ighaghulighwe kwa sendi nyingi, chila litsuwa yeye yang'ali yohondola pfijo pfinoghile. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Hane ha libani lyake likulu, tsakekighwa imunu yumwe mhingwa yakemighwe Lazali yane ipfilonda pfingi, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />yabamile kuja ipfijo ipfilaghale kulawa mmetsa mwe tajiri. Na iwambwa wamghendela wamlambita ipfilonda pfake.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Hambele, Lazali kafa kuya kasolighwa ne wamalaika mbaka mmambagha mwa Abrahamu. Imunu tajiri pfipfila naye kafa kuya katsikighwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Akula kutsimu, ang'ali yodununzika ng'ani, kalola kuchanya, kamwona Abrahamu kwa kutali hamwe na Lazali iyakalile mmambagha mwake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Apfo kamkema kwa ukukemelela, ‘Aba Abrahamu, mbonele libatsi! Umtume Lazali achike ichidole chake mne ghamatsi aluhotse lulimi lwangu, kwaapfila nene namne usungu mkulu mne ghumoto ghuno!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Lekeni Abrahamu kamwidika, ‘Wikumbuke mwanangu, mne ughima wako tsakubokela apfila ipfinoghile na Lazali tsakabokela ipfihile. Lekeni sambi Lazali kabahano kodeng'elela, naghwe kwodununzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Hata apfo, mghati mwetu na mwemwe kwikighwa kolongo kulu, ili imunu iyobama kuloka kulawa kuno kutsa kuna mwemwe aleke kudaha, pfipfila kuduhu imunu iyodaha kuloka kulawa kuna mwemwe kutsa kuna twetwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Imunu tajiri kalonga, ‘Kuya nokulomba aba wangu, umtume Lazali aghende mne kaye ya aba wangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />amo mna ndughu tsangu watano. Mlekelele aghende akawalongele waleke kutenda ka pfanitendile, ili waleke kutsa hanu hano ha kudununzika.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Abrahamu kamwidika, ‘Ndughu tsako wenao Musa na manabii, leka wawategheletse wawo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Tajiri kalonga, ‘Bae aba wangu. Lekeni ka imunu yatsilihuke kowaghendela, watsotsileka nzambi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abrahamu kamlongela, ‘Ka ng'awowategheletsa Musa na manabii, ng'awatsotegheletsa hata ang'atsilihuka imunu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Malk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Kuya, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Pfitsolawila ghendo ipfinu ipfimuhonza imunu atende nzambi, lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula yatsotenda pfilawile. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ing'awile ng'apfu kwe imunu ayo yohighwe libwe lya kusaghila msingo na yasighwe mne ibahali, kubita kumtenda yumwe we iwadodo wano atende nzambi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Mwalangitse! Ka ndughu yako kakutendela ghehile, umlonge, ang'atoghola totso lyake, umlekelele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ang'akutendela ghehile mala saba kwa tsuwa limwe, na ang'akutsila mala saba na kukulongela, ‘Nileka,’ naghwe mlekelele.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Iwatumighwa wamlongela IMNDEWA, “Utwongetsele ukutoghola.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />IMNDEWA kalonga, “Ukutoghola kwenu kung'awile kudodo ka imbeghu ya haladali, mng'adahile kughulongela mbiki ghuno ghwa mkuyu, ‘Ng'oka, wikehande mwibahali!’ Naghwo ghung'awahulikitse.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'onde ye imtumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Tulonge yumwe wenu kana imtumwa iyolima kumghunda au iyodima iwang'olo. Apfi hayakuya kulawa kumghunda, katsomlongela imtumwa ayo, ‘Utse tanu, ukale hasi, uje ichijo?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Bae! Katsomlongela, ‘Nyambikile ichijo, na wanduse kunisang'anila mbaka hanitsomalitsa kuja na kunwa, kuya naghwe uje na unwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Apfi kutsomlongela mighede imtumwa ayo kwaapfila katenda aghala ghalaghitsighwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Pfipfila namwe mng'amalitsa kutenda chila chinu chambamighwe kutenda, mwobamighwa kulonga, ‘Twetwe twa iwatumwa iwali si chinu bae. Tutenda pfatubamighwa kutenda.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwakoma kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu hang'ali kamnzila koghenda Yerusalemu, kabitila mghati mwa Samariya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Hang'ali yakwingila mne ichijiji chimwe, tsaketingana ne iwakoma kumi, wema kutali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Wakemelela, “Yesu, IMNDEWA, twonele libatsi!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Hawonile kawalongela, “Mghende mkelanguse kwa wakulu we inambiko.” Hawang'ali woghenda, tsawahona. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumwe mna wawo honile kahona, koya kuchughu, aku komtunya Imulungu kwa kukemelela. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Keghwisa hasi hane maghulu gha Yesu kamlongela mighede. Ayo tsakakala Msamariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu kalonga, “Apfi si iwanu kumi bae iwahonile? Lelo awala tisa walikwani? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ng'oneke yungi iyoyile na kumtunya Imulungu ila imhenza ayu aliyeka?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Kuya Yesu kamlongela imunu ayo, “Winuke uke, Ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa!”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwa Undewa we Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Mafarisayo hawamghutsile Yesu, Undewa we Imulungu utsakutsa tsuwachi, kawedika, “Undewa we Imulungu ng'aukutsa kwa kwoneka kwa tsinenge bae. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kuduhu imunu iyatsodaha kulonga, ‘Wa hano au wa hala.’ Kwaapfila Undewa we Imulungu wa mghati mwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Ghamatsuwa ghakutsa mtsobama kwona litsuwa limwe lya ghamatsuwa ghe Imwana we Imunu, lekeni ng'amtsolyona bae. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Na iwanu watsowalongela, ‘Mlole, kahala!’ Au ‘Mlole kahano!’ Lekeni mwemwe mleke kuwawinza. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwaapfila ka lumwesa pfalulawila kulanga na kumwemwesa ubali umwe mbaka ubali ungi, apfo pfipfo Imwana we Imunu pfatsakuwa mne litsuwa lyake. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Lekeni tanu yadununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwanu wa mweleko ghuno. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Na ka pfaiwile mne ghamatsuwa gha Nuhu, pfipfila itsakuwa pfipfo mne ghamatsuwa ghe Imwana we Imunu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Iwanu tsawaghendelela kuja na kunwa, kukwela na kukwelighwa mbaka Nuhu hengile mne safina. Kuya mafuriko ghatsa na kuwakoma wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Itsakuwa pfipfo ka pfailawile mne ghamatsuwa gha Lutu. Iwanu tsawaghendelela kuja na kunwa, kughula na kuutsa, kuhanda tsimbeghu na kutsenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Lekeni litsuwa lila Loti hokile Sodoma, ghumoto na ghamabwe igholakatsa ghalaghala hasi kulawa kulanga na kuwalakatsa wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Itsakuwa pfipfo mne litsuwa lila Imwana we Imunu hatsoghubulighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Mna litsuwa alyo, imunu iyali mchiswili aku ipfinu pfake pfa mng'anda, aleke kuhulumka kupfisola, pfipfila iyali kumghunda aleke kuya kuchughu. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mkumbuke ighampatile mwehe wa Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake katsowaghisa, na wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake, katsoukombola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nowalongela, litsuwa alyo nechilo iwanu weli watsowasa hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Iwapinga weli watsotwanga hamwe, yumwe katsosolighwa na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Iwanu weli watsakuwa kumghunda, yumwe katsosolighwa, na yungi katsolekighwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Baho iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Kwani Mtwatsa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Naye kawedika, “Hane ghumtsogha, maghengele watsetinganila baho.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye chitsuka na mlamutsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Kuya Yesu kawapetela iwanang'ina wake imbuli kuwalangulitsa ka wobamighwa kulomba matsuwa ghose, waleke kwipfa. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Kalonga, “Mne ghumji ghumwe tsakukala na mlamutsi, ayo ng'ampfukile bae Imulungu wala ng'awanoghele iwanu bae. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Pfipfila tsakukala ne chitsuka yumwe mne ghumji agho iyang'ali yomghendelagha kumlomba bila kwipfa mlamutsi ayo, ‘Utulamle nene na mwihile wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa matsuwa mengi mlamutsi ayo kalema kumwapfila chitsuka ayo. Lekeni hambele kalonga, ‘Hata ka nene simpfuka bae Imulungu wala siwanoghela iwanu bae, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />lekeni kwaapfila chitsuka ayu konitsupfa, nitsomlamulila, hela koghendelela kunitsila na kunenda nyipfe!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kuya IMNDEWA kaghendelela kulonga, “Muhulikitse pfalongile mlamutsi ayu yehile. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Pfii lelo Imulungu ng'atsowalamulila bae iwanu wala iyawasaghule, iwomlilila chilo na misi? Apfi katsokawa kuwapfila? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nowalongela katsowapfila hima! Hata apfo Imwana we Imunu hatsakutsa, apfi katsopfika iwanu wotoghola mne iisi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Mfarisayo ne imunu iyosola ikodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli ino iwanu wala iweghoda na kuwabetsa wangi. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Iwanu weli waghenda kune ing'anda ye Imulungu kulomba. Yumwe Mfarisayo na yungi imunu iyosola kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ayo Mfarisayo kema, kalomba mne ghumoyo ghwake, ‘Mighede, Ghwe Imulungu, kwaapfila nene si ka iwanu wangi bae, iwoboka, iwotenda ghehile, watsinzi, wala si ka ayu msola kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Nene noleka ukuja ghamatsuwa meli mne ghamatsuwa saba, nolapfa tsaka ye ipfinu pfose pfanipata!’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Lekeni ayula msola kodi kema kutali, wala ng'alolile bae kulanga. Lekeni ketowa mmambagha mwake kwa usungu, kalonga, ‘Ghwe Imulungu, umbonele libatsi, nene mtenda ghehile.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Nowalongela, “Ayu msola kodi koka ukaye yake akuno katogholighwa ne Imulungu kubita ayula yungi. Kwaapfila imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mkulu katsotendighwa mdodo, na imunu wowose yetenda imwenyegho mdodo katsotendighwa mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Iwanu tsawamghalila Yesu iwana wadodo awekile ghamoko. Iwanang'ina wake hawonile apfi, wawakembela. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Lekeni Yesu kawakema iwana wamghendele, kalonga, “Muwaleke iwana wadodo wanitsile, mleke kuwaghoma. Kwaapfila undewa we Imulungu wa iwanu ka wano. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yang'aubokela undewa we Imulungu ka imwana mdodo, ng'atsakwingila bae mne undewa awo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Na mkulu yumwe wa Chiyahudi kamghutsa Yesu, “Mlangulitsi yunoghile, nitende choni ili nidahe kupata ughima wa matsuwa ghose?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Mbona kwonikema ninogha? Kuduhu yanoghile lekeni Imulungu aliyeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Kwoghamanya ghamalaghitso. ‘Uleke utsinzi, uleke kukoma, uleke kulonga ughutsu, wategheletse aba wako na mai wako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Kamwidika, “Agho ghose nighakinda kulawa udodo wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu haulike apfo kamlongela, “Kuhungukighwa na ichinu chimwe. Utsa pfose pfawinapfo na sendi uwagholele wahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa na utajiri kulanga. Kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Lekeni imunu ayo haulike apfi, kwona usungu ng'ani kwaapfila tsakakala tajiri ng'ani.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu hamwonile kakona usungu, kalonga, “Pfikomu ng'ani kwa matajiri kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Kwaapfila pfibewe kwa ngamiya kwingila mne litobo lye isindano kubita tajiri kwingila mne undewa we Imulungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Awala iwahulike apfo waghutsa, “Lelo yuhi yodaha kukombolighwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu kedika, “Ichinu ing'achidahika kwe iwanu, kwe Imulungu chodahika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Kuya Petiri kalonga, “Lola! Twetwe tupfileka ipfinu pfetu pfose twokuwinza ghweghwe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyalekile ing'anda yake au mwehe wake au iwandughu tsake au iwamweleke au iwanaghe kwaajili ya undewa we Imulungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />katsobokela pfingi mna matsuwa agha, na ughima wa matsuwa ghose mne chipindi ichikutsa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwa kadatu ukufa kwake na ukutsilihuka kwake.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu tsakawasola awala kumi na weli kawalongela, “Mlole! Twoghenda Yerusalemu, na chila chinu chandikighwe na manabii che Imwana we Imunu chitsolawila. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwaapfila katsakwikighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae. Nawo watsombetsa, watsomligha, watsombwalulila ghamate, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />watsomfapula pfiboko, kuya watsomkoma. Mne litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Lekeni iwanang'ina ng'awamanyile bae ichinu acho. Tsawapfisighwa mana ye imbuli ayo, na ng'awatangile ighalongighwe.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu hapfikile habehi na Yeriko, imunu yumwe ichifita tsakakala mmbalimbali mwe inzila kolomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Haulike iwanu wobita, kaghutsa, “kuna choni?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Wamlongela, “Yesu wa Natsareti kobita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Naye kakemelela, “Yesu, Mtsukulu wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Wanu wala iwalongole wamkembela wamlongela anyamale, lekeni yeye kaghendelela kukemelela, “Mtsukulu wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu kema kalaghitsa wamghale imunu ayo hana yeye. Hapfikile habehi, Yesu kamghutsa, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Kwobama nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Kedika, “IMNDEWA, nobama mbone.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu kamlongela, “Wone! Kutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa!”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Bahala ichifita ayo kadaha kona, kamuwinza Yesu, aku komtunya Imulungu. Iwanu wose hawonile apfo, nawo pfipfila wamtunya Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu tsakengila mne ghumji ghwa Yeriko na yang'ali yobita mghati mwa ghumji agho. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Na ako kukala ne imunu yumwe taghwa lyake Zakayo, imkulu we iwasola kodi, naye tsakakala tajiri. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Tsakabama amwone Yesu yalitse, lekeni ng'adahile bae kwaapfila tsahana iwanu wengi, naye tsakakala mghuyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Apfo katsuma, kawalongolela iwanu, kadina mchanya mwe mkuyu ili amwone Yesu, kwaapfila katsobitila inzila iila. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu hapfikile hanu hala, kalola mchanya, kamlongela Zakayo, “Zakayo, hima uhulumke, kwaapfila leloli nobamighwa nisinde mng'anda mwako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Apfo Zakayo kuhulumka himahima kambokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Iwanu wose hawonile apfo, wandusa kunung'unika na ukulonga, “Kaghenda kukala kwa ‘imunu yane nzambi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Lekeni Zakayo kema, kamlongela Yesu, “Lola IMNDEWA, nene nitsoweng'a wahingwa inusu ye ipfinu pfangu, na ka nimboka imunu wowose ichinu, nitsomuyitsila mala nne.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu kamlongela, “Leloli ukombotsi upfika mne ing'anda ino, kwaapfila ayu naye kamtsukulu wa Abrahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mana Imwana wa Imunu katsa kubama na kukombola iwanu iwaghile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwatumwa kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Hawahulike agho, Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela imbuli, kwaapfila tsakakala habehi na Yerusalemu, nawo tsawapfikitsa ka undewa we Imulungu wahabehi kulawila. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Apfo kalonga, “Imunu yumwe wa lukolo lwa chindewa tsakaghenda mne isi ya kutali akabokele undewa kuya yoye ukaye. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Apfo kawakema iwanu kumi kulawa mne iwatumwa wake, kaweng'a tsisendi kawalongela, ‘Mtsitendele ng'onde ya kuchuutsa pfinu mbaka hanitsakuya.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Lekeni iwanu wa ghumji ghwake wamuhila, wawatuma iwanu wamghendele wakalonge, ‘Ng'atumbama bae imunu yuno atutawale.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Haubokele undewa, tsakoya kalaghitsa iwatumwa yaweng'ile sendi wakemighwe ili amanye chawapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wamwanduso katsa, kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa sendi yako yungayile yeleka pfibughulu kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kamlongela, ‘Ghoya, mtumwa yunoghile. Kwaapfila kutogholighwa mna chinu chidodo, kwakuwa mkulu mne imiji kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Na wa keli katsa, kalonga, ‘Mndewa, sendi yako tsungayile tseleka pfibughulu pfitano!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Naye kamlongela, ‘Naghwe kutsakuwa mkulu mne imiji mitano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Kuya mtumwa yungi kalonga, ‘Mtwatsa, sendi yako ino tsaniifidika mne chitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Mana tsanikupfuka kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa imunu mkali. Kosola ipfinu pfang'upfikile, na kupfuna achila ng'auchihandile bae.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mtwatsa wake kamlongela, ‘Nitsokuhigha kwa achila chulongile, ghwe imtumwa wihile! Tsakumanya nene ne imunu mkali, nosola apfila si pfikile bae na nopfuna apfila sipfihandile bae, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />ebali ng'awikile bae sendi yangu kubengi, na hanikuya niibokele kuno yongetseka.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Kuya kawalongela iwemile habehi, ‘Mbokeni sendi ayo, mkamwing'e yula yane kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nawo wamlongela, ‘Mtwatsa, ma kenatso kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Naye kawedika, ‘Nowalongela chila yane chinu katsakongetsighwa, lekeni ayula yalihela chinu, hata chila chenacho katsobokighwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Sambi awala iwehile wangu iwolema nene ndeke kuwa mndewa wawo, waghaleni hano na muwakome aku nene nolola.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa kudeng'elelighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu hamalitse kulonga apfo, kawalongolela kaghenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Hapfikile habehi na Betifage na Betaniya, kune chidunda ichikemighwa Mitseituni, kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />kawalongela, “Mghende mne tsikaye tsila tsamtsilola. Hamkwingila mna tsikaye atso, mtsomwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa, ng'ana yadinighwe ne imunu bae. Mumdohole mumghale hano <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Imunu wowose ang'awaghutsa, ‘Ebali mwumdohola?’ Mumlongele, ‘Mtwatsa kombama.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Na awala iwatumighwe waghenda wapfika ka Yesu pfawalongele. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Hawang'ali womdohola imwana we ipunda, iwenyegho wawaghutsa, “Ebali mwomdohola imwana we ipunda?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nawo wedika, “Mtwatsa kombama.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Kuya wamghala kwa Yesu, watandika maghwanda ghao mmughongo mwa imwana we ipunda wamdinitsa Yesu mchanya mwake. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Na hang'ali yoghenda, iwanu watandika maghwanda ghawo mnzila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Hapfikile habehi na mhulumko ghwa chidunda cha Mitseituni, mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanang'ina wake wandusa kudeng'elela na kumtunya Imulungu kwa kukemelela, kwa aghala makulu ghawonile. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">“Kebweda Imndewa iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye IMNDEWA!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">Kulanga kukale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">ne utunitso kuchanya kulanga!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Mafarisayo wamwenga iwakalile mna mtingano ghula wamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, uwalonge iwanang'ina wako wenyamale!” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela, hawano wang'enyamala, ghamabwe ghano ghatsolapfa litsi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolililila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Hapfikile habehi na Yerusalemu na kughwona ghumji, kaghulilila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />kalonga, “Ung'amanyile leloli ipfinu ipfighala tseghamba! Lekeni sambi pfifisighwa mnenge mwako. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghatsokutsila, iwehile wako hawatsotsenga maboma, watsokupfingilila na kukubanyabanya chila ubali. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Watsokuhonda ghweghwe ne iwanagho mghati mwa mibanda yako. Ng'awatsokulekela libwe limwe mchanya mwe libwe, kwaapfila ng'umanyile bae ichipindi cha ukutsa kwe Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kune ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Kuya Yesu kengila kune ing'anda ye Imulungu, kandusa kuwawinga kunze iwanu iwang'ali woutsa ipfinu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa, ‘Ing'anda yangu itsakuwa ng'anda ya ukulombela.’ Lekeni mwemwe muitenda iwe mango ya wabapfi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Chila litsuwa Yesu tsakalangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Iwakulu we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwakulu we iwanu tsawabama wamkome, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />lekeni ng'awapatile bae nzila ya kumkomela, kwaapfila iwanu wose wang'ali womuhulikitsa.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Yesu Woghutsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Litsuwa limwe Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, na kuwapetela imbuli inoghile. Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala wamtsila <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />wamghutsa, “Utulongele, kwe ukulu wachi kwotenda ipfinu pfino? Kuya yuhi yakwing'ile ukulu uno?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Kawedika, “Na nene nitsowaghutsa imbuli imwe; nilongeleni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ubatitso wa Yohane ulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Lekeni wawo welongetsa iwenyegho, na walonga, “Tung'alonga ulawa kulanga, katsotughutsa, ‘Ebali ng'amumtoghole bae Yohane?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Na tung'alonga ulawa kwe iwanu, iwanu wose watsotutowa kwa ghamabwe, kwaapfila wose wamtoghola Yohane kughwa kakala nabii.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Apfo wedika, “Ng'atumanyile bae ulawile kwani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu kawalongela, “Na nene siwalongela bae kwe ukulu wachi notenda ipfinu pfino.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya mghunda wa mitsabibu ne iwakulima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu kaghendelela kuwalongela iwanu imbuli ino. “Imunu yumwe tsakahanda sabibu mne mghunda wake. Keka iwakulima, kuya koka kukala mne isi ingi kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Msimu wa kuhuna haghupfikile, kamtuma imtumwa kwe iwakulima ili wamgholele ghamatunda gha mitsabibu. Lekeni iwakulima wala wamtowa na wamuwinga ghamoko ghaliyeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kamtuma imtumwa yungi. Ayo naye wamtowa na wamtendela pfinu pfa chinyala na kumuyitsa ghamoko ghaliyeka. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Kamtuma na wa kadatu. Ayu naye wamlagha na kumuwinga. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kuya, yula yane mghunda kalonga, ‘Nitende choni? Nitsomtuma imwanangu iyanimnoghele. Ayu watsompfuka ghendo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Lekeni awala iwakulima hawamwonile, welongetsa iwenyegho, ‘Hayuno iyo muhala mghunda, leka tumkome na uhala wake uwe wetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Apfo wamlapfa kunze mwa mghunda wa mitsabibu, wamkoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi imunu yane mghunda katsowatenda choni iwakulima wala? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Katsakutsa kuwakoma iwakulima awo, na kuweng'a iwanu wangi mghunda awo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Iwanu hawahulike imbuliyo walonga, “Mbe! Agho ghaleke kulawila!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Lekeni Yesu kawatsodolela tsinenge, kalonga, “Kuya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghano choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Libwe iwalilemile iwotsenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Alyo liwa libwe kulu lya haghatighati?’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Imunu wowose iyokughwa mna libwe awo katsobenekabeneka, ne imunu wowose litsomghwila litsomhonda ghendo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukuliha kodi kwa Kaisari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne Watambika wakulu tsawabama wamghoghe Yesu bahala, kwaapfila wamanya ka imbuli ila walongighwa wawo. Lekeni tsawawapfuka iwanu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Apfo wakala wobama ichipindi chinoghile. Wawatuma iwanu iwetendile wanogha, wamghoghe Yesu kwa kumghutsa mbuli, ili wadahe kumghala kwe imkulu we undewa wa Roma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Iwanu awo wamghutsa, “Imlangulitsi, twomanya ghweghwe kwolonga na kwolangulitsa ipfinu pfinoghile, ng'aulola bae ukulu we imunu, lekeni kwolangulitsa inzila ye Imulungu kwe ukweli. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Apfi pfinogha kumwing'a kodi Kaisari au ng'apfinoghile bae?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Lekeni Yesu kamanya ukwiha kwawo, kawalongela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Nilanguseni isendi. Ina uhanga wa nani na taghwa lya nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Wamwidika, “Wa imndewa Kaisari.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Apfo Yesu kawalongela, “Ipfinu pfa Kaisari mmwing'e Kaisari, ne ipfinu pfe Imulungu mwing'eni Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ng'awadahile bae kumghogha kwe achila chialongile hambele he iwanu. Na wakangawala pfaawedike, wanyamala.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya kutsilihuka kwe iwafile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Masadukayo iwalongagha kuduhu kutsilihuka. Wamwenga wamtsila Yesu na kumghutsa, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Imlangulitsi, Musa tsakatwandikila. ‘Imunu ang'afiwa na ndughu yake yane mwehe, lekeni kahela imwana, imunu ayo yamkwele ipinga ayo, ili yamwelekele ndughu yake iwana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Tsakukala ne iwandughu saba. Wa mwanduso kakwela mwehe, naye kafa ng'alekile iwana bae. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Na wa keli kamsola ipingayo, naye kafa ng'alekile iwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Kuya wa kadatu kamkwela, na pfipfila wose saba, wafa ng'awalekile iwana bae. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Mwiso ipinga yula naye kafa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Lelo mne litsuwa lya kutsilihuka kakuwa mwehe wa yuhi? Kwaapfila tsakakwelighwa na wose saba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu kawalongela, “Iwanu wa ghamatsuwa ghano wokwela na kukwelighwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />lekeni awala iwasaghulighwe watsilihuke kulawa mne lifwa na wawe ne ugima, ng'awatsokwela bae wala kukwelighwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ng'awatsakufa keli bae, kwaapfila watsokuwa ka wamalaika. Nawo wa iwana we Imulungu kwaapfila watsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Lekeni, kulonga iwanu iwafile watsotsilihuka, hata Musa tsakalangusa apfo mne imbuli ya chibagho ichikwaka, baho hayalongile IMNDEWA ka Imulungu we Abrahamu, ne Imulungu we Isaka ne Imulungu wa Yakobu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Naye si Imulungu wa iwanu iwafile bae, lekeni yeye ka Imulungu wa wene ughima. Kwaapfila wose wokala waghima kuna yeye.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wangi we iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso walonga, “Imlangulitsi kulonga ghoya!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nawo ng'awadahile bae kumghutsa keli imbuli.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Angu pfii iwanu wolonga Kiristu ka Imwana we Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Kwaapfila Daudi imwenyegho kolonga mne ichitabu cha Tsaburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘IMNDEWA tsakamlongela IMNDEWA wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Ukale mne ubali wangu wa kujilo.<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mbaka niwatende iwanebe wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:43">wawe hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako. ka chighoda cha kwikila maghulu’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Daudi kamkema ‘IMNDEWA,’ Pfii lelo yadahe kuwa imwanaghe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ne iwanu wose hawakalile wamtegheletsa, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Mkale meso ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso, iwonoghelwa ukwanga kuno wapfala ghamaghwanda matali na kulamutsighwa mmasoko, na kukala mne ipfighoda pfili ambele mne tsing'anda tse ukulombela na mne ipfihungo. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Iwebagha mna tsing'anda tse pfitsuka na kwe ung'enye wolomba kwe ichipindi chitali. Awano watsohighighwa ng'ani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Nosa ye chitsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:41-44">Mat 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu kenula meso, kawona wane tsimali pfowoghela sadaka tsawo mne chinu cha kwikila sadaka. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Pfipfila kamwona chitsuka yumwe mhingwa koghela sendi mbili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Kawalongela, “Nowalongela ghendo, chitsuka ayu kalapfa kubita wose. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwaapfila wose walapfa sadaka itsisidile mna tsimali tsawo, lekeni chitsuka ayu mne uhingwa wake kalapfa pfose pfakalile napfo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga pfaitsohinyighwa ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malk 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Ne iwanang'ina wangi wakala wolonga imbuli ye ing'anda ye Imulungu, pfaitsengighwe kwa ghamabwe ghanoghile na nosa itsilapfighwe ne iwanu kumwing'a Imulungu. Lekeni Yesu kalonga, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Agha ghose ghamkona, ghamatsuwa ghatsakutsa, ghatsobomolighwa libwe mchanya mwe libwe lingi, chila limwe litsakwatsighwa hasi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Iwanu wamghutsa Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, ipfinu apfo pfitsolawila tsuwachi? Ne ichitango chitsokughwa choni ichipindi ipfinu apfo pfa habehi kutsa?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Kedika, “Mwalangitse, mleke kughutsukighwa. Kwaapfila wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu, wolonga, ‘Nene iyo imwenyegho,’ ne, ‘Ichipindi cha habehi.’ Mwemwe mleke kuwawinza. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Na mng'ahulika imbuli ye ing'ondo na kughaya, mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila ipfinu apfo pfobamighwa tanu pfilawile, lekeni umwisho ng'aukukutsa hima bae.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Iwanu wa isi ino wetsotowa ne iwanu wa isi ila, ne undewa utsotowa ne undewa. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Kutsolawila imidedemo mikulu ye isi, ne inzala ne utamu chila hanu. Na kutsolawila ipfinu pfa kupfukighwa, ne ipfitango pfikulu kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Lekeni agho ghose ng'ana ghalawile, watsowaghogha na kuwadununza. Watsowaghala mna tsing'anda tse ukulombela, na mne pfifungo, na watsowaghala kwe wandewa na kwe iwatawala kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Kubitila agho mtsowapetela Imbuli Inoghile. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Lekeni mne imimoyo yenu, mleke ukwalangula pfamtsowedika. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kwaapfila nene nitsoweng'a imbuli ye ukulonga na nzewele. Kuduhu iwanebe wenu watsodaha kuilema wala kwisonga agho ghamlongile. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Namwe mtsohundukighwa hata na welesi wenu, iwandughu tsenu ne iwanu wa habehi namwe na sale tsenu. Nawo watsowakoma wangi wenu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Iwanu wose watsowahila kwaajili ya taghwa lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Lekeni ng'aitsokwagha hata imvili imwe ya ghamatwi ghenu. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kwa kududumila kwenu mtsobokela ughima.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Hamtsolyona ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu litsungulukighwa ne asikali, baho mmanye kughwa ukuhinyighwa kwake kwa habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Baho wali mne isi ye Yudeya watsumile kupfidunda, ne iwali mghati mwe ghumji watsumile kunze, na wose iwali mne imighunda waleke kwingila mna ghumji. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwaapfila hagho ghatsokughwa ghamatsuwa gha kuhighighwa ili ghose ighandikighwe ghalawile. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Watsoghaya ng'ani iwapinga wane inda ne iwoghwaghwisa mne ghamatsuwa hagho! Kwaapfila kutsokughwa na kughaya ng'ani mne isi, ne Imulungu katsowahigha iwanu we isi ino. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Watsokomighwa kwa limaghe, na watsosolighwa mateka ne isi tsose. ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghutsobajughighwa ne iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae, mbaka ichipindi che iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae hachitsotimila.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa kwa Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Malk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kuya kutsokughwa ne ipfitango mne litsua, mne ghumwetsi na mne tsinondo. Mne isi kutsokughwa na kughaya kwaajili ya kupfuka litsi lye ibahali na ghamawimbi ghake. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Iwanu watsotsilika kwa kupfuka, kwa kubetetsa ighakutsa mne isi yose, kwaapfila ipfinu pfa kulanga pfitsohighisika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Baho watsomwone Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mne libingu ne ingupfu ne utunitso mkulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Na baho ipfinu apfo hapfitsokwandusa kulawila, msangalale. Mwinule ghamatwi ghenu kwaapfila ukombotsi wenu wahabehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha mbiki wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela imbuli. “Loleni ghumtini ne imibiki yose. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Hamkwona imitsani yake yochipula, mwomanya kughwa chiangatsi chahabehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Namwe pfipfila hamkwona ipfinu apfo pfolawila, mmanye undewa we Imulungu wahabehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko uno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka ipfinu apfo pfilawile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Lilanga ne isi tsitsoluta, lekeni mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta mbe.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkale meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mwalangitse! Imimoyo yenu ileke kughoghighwa ne kuja ng'ani, kupatika na kughaya kwaajili ye ughima uno, na litsuwa lila liwatsile kwa kuwadukitsa ka ghumtegho pfaughogha. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwaapfila litsowatsila iwanu wose iwokala mne uhanga we isi yose. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Apfo mkale meso ghamatsuwa ghose, mlombe mdahe ukukomboka mne hagho ghose ghatsolawila, na kwima hambele he Imwana we Imunu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Chila litsuwa Yesu kakala kolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu na nechilo koghenda kune chidunda cha Mitseituni na kukala ako. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ne iwanu wose wakala wolamka nemitondotondo na kughenda mne ing'anda ye Imulungu kumtegheletsa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ichihungo cha pfighate pfilihela hamila, ichikemighwe Ichihungo che Ipasaka chikala chahabehi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Na ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wang'ali wobama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu, lekeni wang'ali wowapfuka iwanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Kuya Setani kamwingila Yuda yakemighwe Isikarioti, yumwe wa wala iwanang'ina kumi na weli. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Naye kaghenda kwa ipfilongotsi we inambiko ne iwakulu wa iwanu iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu, kalonga nawo pfatsodaha kumhunduka Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nawo wadeng'elela na watoghola kumwing'a sendi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda katoghola na kandusa kubama uleghelo wa ukumhunduka Yesu ichipindi kuduhu kingili lye iwanu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu keyandaa ukuja ichijo che Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Malk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Litsuwa tsalipfika lye Ichihungo cha Pfighate ipfilihela hamila. Pfipfila likala litsuwa lya kukomighwa kwe iwang'olo we Ichihungo che Ipasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Apfo Yesu kawatuma Petiri na Yohane, kawalongela, “Mghende mkatutengele ichijo ili tuje Ipasaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nawo wamghutsa, “Kobama tukakutengele kwani?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Kawedika, “Baho hamkwingila mne ghumji, mtsetingana ne immale yaghalile libigha lya ghamatsi. Mmuwinze mbaka mne ing'anda yatsakwingila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Na mtsomlongela yane ing'anda, ‘Imlangulitsi koghutsa, chilikwani chiheleto che iwahenza, ndiye Ipasaka hamwe ne iwanang'ina wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naye katsowalangusa chiheleto chikulu cha uchanya, ichikwighwe ghoya. Namwe mtenge ichijo amo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Waghenda wachipfika chila ichinu ka Yesu pfawalongele, nawo watenga ichijo cha Ipasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo che Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Malk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wak 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Isaa haipfikile, Yesu kawasola iwatumighwa wake kakala nawo mchijo. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kawalongela, “Nosulukila kuja ichijo chino che Ipasaka na mwemwe ng'ana nidununzike! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Nowalongela ghendo, sitsakuja keli bae mbaka Pasaka haitsolawila mne Undewa we Imulungu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Yesu kasola ichikombe che dipfai, kalonga, “Mighede ghwe Imulungu.” Kuya kawalongela, “Mchisole mwose mchisole. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nowalongela kulawa sambi sitsoinwa bae idipfai ino mbaka Undewa we Imulungu utse.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kuya kasola chighate, kalonga, “Mighede Imulungu.” Kachibena, kaweng'a, kalonga, “Aluno lukuli lwangu lwamwing'ighwe mwemwe. Mtende pfino kwa kung'umbuka nene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Pfipfila, hawamalitse kuja ichijo cha nemihe, kaweng'a ichikombe kalonga, “Achi ichikombe cha lilaghano lya sambi lye Imulungu ilili mne idamu yangu, iimwitikilani mwemwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Lekeni ghumoko ghwa ayula yatsonihunduka ghwa hamwe na nene mmetsa! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Imwana we Imunu katsakufa ka pfailamlighwe, lekeni katsoghaya ng'ani imunu yula iyomhunduka!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Wandusa kwighutsa iwenyegho, yuhi mna wawo yatsotenda ichinu acho.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Pfipfila wandusa kwihisanya yuhi mna wawo yatsakuwa mkulu kubita wose. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu kawalongela, “Iwandewa wa iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wowatawala iwanu kwe ingupfu, na wala wane ukulu mna wawo wokemighwa ‘Sale tse iwanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Lekeni kuna mwemwe si pfipfo bae. Yali mkulu na yawe ka mdodo kubita wose, na chilongotsi yawe ka imunu iyotumikila. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kwaapfila yuhi yali mkulu? Yula iyokala mmetsa, au yula iyakwika ichijo? Ambe yula iyokala mmetsa? Lekeni nene namghati mwenu ka imunu iyosang'ana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Namwe mkala na nene mne ukughetsighwa kwangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Na nene nomwing'ani undewa, ka apfila aba wangu pfangahile nene. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Mdahe ukuja ne ukunwa mmetsa mwangu mne undewa wangu, na kukala mne ipfighoda pfa undewa na kughahigha ghamakabila kumi na meli gha Isiraeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga Petiri pfatsombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu kalonga, “Simoni, Simoni, ukale meso! Setani tsakabama kuwabeta mwemwe ka uhunga. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Lekeni nikulombela ghweghwe Simoni, ukutoghola kwako kuleke kuhunguka, naghwe hautsombuyila keli uwapfile iwandughu tsako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petiri kamlongela, “IMNDEWA, nene nitoghola kughenda na ghweghwe mchifungo na hata ukukomighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela Petiri, leloli jogholo ng'ana yeke ghweghwe kutsonibela mala ndatu, ka ng'unimanyile bae!”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwiyandae kwa ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Pfii hala haniwatumile aku mwahela ghumfuko au mkoba au pfilatu, tsamuhungukighwa na chinu?” Walonga, “Bae! Ng'atuhungukighwe na chinu bae.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Kawalongela, “Lekeni sambi yane ghumfuko aghusole, na yane mkoba pfipfila aghusole. Naye yalihela lipanga autse lighwanda lyake ne aghule limwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwaapfila Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka aghala igholonga. ‘Naye katsopetighwa ne iwanu wehile’ ghotimila. Nowalongela, hagho ghose ighandikighwe kwaajili ya nene ghobamighwa ghatimile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Iwanang'ina walonga, “Mtwatsa, lola, hano hana mimaghe mili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Kawalongela, “Ona.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba mne lughongo lwe Mitseituni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu kaghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni ka pfatsowele, na wanang'ina wake wamuwinza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Hawapfikile ako, kawalongela, “Mlombe mleke kwingila mne ukughetsighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kuya kawaleka, kaghenda utali wa imunu kudaha ukwasa libwe. Katowa ghamaghoti, kalomba, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Ghwe Aba, ung'abama uchilapfe ichikombe chino kuna nene. Lekeni si ka pfanibama nene bae, lekeni ka pfubama ghweghwe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Baho malaika kamlawila, kamwing'a ingupfu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Naye kwaapfila pfakalile mne usungu, tsakalomba ng'ani. Lijasho lyake tsalikala ka ghamadondwe gha idamu gholaghala hasi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Hamalitse kulomba, kawaghendela iwanang'ina wake. Kawapfika wawasa, kwaapfila tsawana usungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kawalongela, “Pfii mbona muwasa? Mlamke mlombe, mleke kwingila mne ukughetsighwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu hang'ali yolonga, kingili lye iwanu litsa aku lyongotsighwa na Yuda, yakalile yumwe mna iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli. Kamghendela Yesu, kamnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Lekeni Yesu kamghutsa, “Yuda, kwomhunduka Imwana we Imunu kwa kumnonela?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Na wala iwakalile habehi naye hawonile ighatsolawila, walonga, “Mtwatsa, tuwateme na ghamapanga?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na yumwe mna wawo kamtowa imtumwa we Mtambika mkulu, kamsepula ghutwi lyake lya kujilo.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Lekeni Yesu kalonga, “Mleke kutenda keli!” Kamkinda ghutwi lyake, kamhonetsa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwakulu we iwanu, iwokalitsa ing'anda ye Imulungu, ne iwabala iwamtsile yeye, “Pfii mtsa na ghamapanga ne ipfilungu ka nene na mbapfi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ghamatsuwa ghose tsanikala na mwemwe mne ing'anda ye Imulungu ng'amnighoghile bae. Lekeni aino iyo isaa yenu, na utawala wa chisi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Malk 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohn 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Kuya wamghogha Yesu, waghenda naye mne ing'anda ye Imtambika mkulu. Petiri kamuwinza kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Na hawabwinile ghumoto haghati he chibwalu cha libaratsa, wakala hamwe. Petiri naye kakala nawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Na imtumwa yumwe ipinga kamwona Petiri kakala mne ghumwanga. Kamlola ghoya, kalonga, “Imunu yuno naye tsakakala na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Lekeni Petiri kabela, kalonga, “Ghwe ipinga ghwe, nene simmanyile bae.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Hambele chidogho, imunu yungi kamwona Petiri, naye kalonga, “Ghweghwe naghwe kwa yumwe wawo.” Lekeni Petiri kalonga, “Aka, si nene bae!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kuya ibita isaa imwe, imunu yungi kalonga, “Ayu tsakakala naye ghendo, kwaapfila naye Mgalilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Petiri kalonga, “Ghwe imunu ghwe, chulonga sichimanyile bae!” Baho hang'ali yolonga, jogholo keka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />IMNDEWA kahunduka, kamlola Petiri. Naye Petiri kakumbuka imbuli iyamlongele IMNDEWA, “Leloli jogholo ng'ana yeke ghweghwe kutsonibela mala ndatu, ka ng'unimanyile bae!” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petiri kalawa kunze, kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobetsighwa na kutowighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Malk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Iwanu iwang'ali womkalitsa Yesu wandusa kumbetsa na kumtowa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wamtowa aku wamghubika tsinenge, wamghutsa, “Utange! Yuhi yakutowile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Kuya walonga mbuli nyingi tsa ukumligha.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa hane libalatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nemitondo haipfikile, iwabala, ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso tsawetingana hamwe, wamghala Yesu kune libalatsa lyawo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Walonga, “Tulongele ka ghweghwe kwa Kiristu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu kawalongela, “Ning'awalongela, mwemwe ng'amtsotoghola bae, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na ning'awaghutsa, ng'amtsakwidika. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Lekeni kulawa sambi na kughendelela, Imwana we Imunu katsokala ubali wa kujilo we Imulungu yane Ingupfu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Kuya wose wamghutsa, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu?” Naye kawedika, “Mwemwe mwolonga nene iyo yuyo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Walonga, “Lelo twobama ukalangama ungi? Twetwe tuwenyegho tuhulika chalongile!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu hane libalatsa lya Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kuya wose wenuka wamghala Yesu kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Wandusa kumlapfila maghomba, walonga, “Tumwona imunu yuno kowaghisa iwanu wetu. Kawaghoma kuliha kodi kwa mndewa wa Roma, kuya kolonga yeye iyo Kiristu, imndewa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe kwa mndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, ka ghweghwe pfulonga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kuya Pilato kawalongela Wakulu we Inambiko na mtingano we iwanu, “Sonile bae totso lye imunu yuno.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Lekeni wawo wakomangitsa ghendo, “Kwa ghamalangulitso ghake kowasongetsa iwanu iwali Yudeya yose wehisanye na undewa wa Roma. Kandusila Galilaya mbaka akuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato hahulike agho, kaghutsa ka Yesu imunu wa Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Hamanyile ka Yesu kolawila isi iyoitawala Herodi, kamghala kwa Herodi, iyakalile Yerusalemu ghamatsuwa agho. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herodi hamwonile Yesu, kadeng'elela ng'ani kwaapfila kwa ghamatsuwa mengi tsaang'ali yobama amwone. Kwaapfila tsakahulika mbuli tsake, na ang'ali yomlolela Yesu yatende pfinu pfa kukangawatsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Apfo Herodi kamghutsa mbuli nyingi, lekeni Yesu ng'amwidike bae. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Wakulu we inambiko na Walangulitsi wa Ghamalaghitso tsawema hala, wamlapfila Yesu maghomba kwe ingupfu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herodi ne asikali wake wamtendela Yesu pfihile na wambetsa. Kuya wampfatsa lighwanda linoghile wamuyitsa kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kulawa baho Herodi tsakawa sale wa Pilato. Kwaapfila ghumwande tsawang'ali wehila.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato kawakema hamwe Iwakulu we Inambiko, iwabala, ne iwanu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kuya kawalongela, “Mumghala imunu yuno kuna nene ka imunu iyowaghitsa iwanu wehisanye na undewa wa Roma. Nene nilamla mbuli tsake akuno mwemwe mwolola, lekeni sonile bae chochose chihile mne maghomba ghamlongile kuna yeye. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Naye Herodi pfipfila katuyitsila twetwe munu yuno, kwaapfila ng'onile bae totso lyake. Apfo, imunu ayu ng'atendile chochose bae ichimtenda akomighwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Apfo nitsomtowa kuya nitsomlekelela.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwaapfila Herodi tsakabamighwa amlekelele mwohighwa yumwe mne chihungo. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Iwanu wose wakemelela lumwe, “Umkome imunu ayu! Utulekelele Baraba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba tsakakala imunu yekighwe mchifungo kwa kutenda hengele na ukukoma mne ghumji. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato tsakabama kumlekelela Yesu, apfo kalonga nawo keli. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Lekeni wakemelela, “Muwambe mna msalaba! Muwambe mna msalaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Kawalongela lwakadatu, “Ebali? Atendile choni chihile? Sonile bae totso lyolyose lihile ilimtenda yakomighwe. Apfo nitsompfapula, kuya nomlekelela.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Lekeni wakemelela ng'ani, wabama Yesu yawambighwe mna msalaba. Na kwa kukemelela kwawo wamtenda Pilato atoghole. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Apfo Pilato kalamla chawabamile chitendeke. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kamlekelela ayula yawambamile, ayula yekighwe mchifungo kwa hengele na ukukoma, kamlapfa Yesu yakomighwe ka pfawabamile.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambighwa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Hawang'ali womghala, watingana ne imunu yumwe yakemighwe Simoni, imunu wa Kirene, iyang'ali iyolawa kumghunda. Wamghogha wamtwika msalaba yaughale kuchughu kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Iwanu wengi wamuwinza, hamwe ne iwapinga iwang'ali womlilila na ukunyanyana. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Lekeni Yesu kawahundukila kawalongela, “Iwapinga wa Yerusalemu, mleke kundilila nene, ila mwililile iwenyegho na iwanenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa ghakutsa hawatsolonga, ‘Wabweda iwapinga iwalihela iwana, ing'aweleke iwana na yang'awakong'ese bae.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Kuya watsopfilongela pfidunda, ‘Tughwileni!’ Na pfidunda, ‘Tughubikeni!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwaapfila ka iwanu wotenda pfinu pfino kwa mbiki mbisi, itsokuwatse kwa mbiki iusakale?” <verse eid="LUK 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Iwanu wangi iwabapfi pfipfila waghalighwa wakomighwe hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Hawapfikile hanu hakemighwe “Bombwe lya Litwi,” baho wamuwamba Yesu na awala iwanu wehile mne misalaba, yumwe ubali wake wa kujilo na yungi ubali wake wa kumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu kalonga, “Aba, wonele libatsi kwaapfila ng'awamanyile bae chawotenda.” Nawo wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa kutowa simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Iwanu tsawema baho wolola, iwakulu wa Wayahudi hawang'ali wombetsa. Walonga, “Tsakawakombola iwanu wangi, leka yekombole imwenyegho, ka yeye Kiristu, Imkombotsi iyasaghulighwe ne Imulungu!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Asikali pfipfila wambetsa. Wamghendela wamwing'a isiki, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />wamlongela, “Ka ghweghwe kwa imndewa wa Wayahudi, wikombole umwenyegho!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Mchanya mwa msalaba wake tsakukala ne ichitango chino. “Ayuno iyo Imndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mbapfi yumwe mna awala iwabapfi iwawambighwe kamligha Yesu, kalonga, “Pfii ghweghwe si Kiristu bae? Wikombole imwenyegho kuya utukombole na twetwe!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Lekeni ayula mbapfi yungi kamkembela miyaghe kalonga, “Ghweghwe! Ng'umpfuka Imulungu bae, naghwe kuhighighwa ka yeye? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Nene na ghweghwe tuhighighwa kwa haki, apfo twobokela maliho gha aghala ghatutendile. Lekeni imunu ayu ng'atendile bae chochose chihile.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kuya kalonga, “Ghwe Yesu ghwe, hautsakutsa mne undewa wako, uleke kunisemwa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela ghendo, leloli kutsokala na nene kulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Tsaikala saa sita, kung'ali ne ichisi muisi mwose mbaka saa tisa <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Kuya lipatsiya lye ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka pfihindi pfili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Baho Yesu kakemelela, kalonga, “Aba, mne ghamoko ghako nakwika muhe wangu!” Hayalongile apfo, kafa. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Yula imkulu we asikali ghana limwe wa chilumi honile ighalawile, kamtunya Imulungu, kalonga, “Kweli imunu ayu tsakanogha!” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Iwanu wose iwetingane kulola ipfinu apfo, hawonile ighalawile, waghenda mmakaye mwawo, wetowatowa mmambagha mwawo kwa usungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Lekeni awala wose iwammanyile wema kwa kutali, wolola ipfinu apfo. Mghati mwawo tsawakala iwapinga iwamuwinzile Yesu kulawa Galilaya.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosikighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:38-42">Yohn 10:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Tsakukala ne imunu yumwe, taghwa lyake Yosefu yolawila Arimataya mne ghumji ghwa Yudeya. Imunu yuno tsakanogha, na mtenda ghanoghile naye yang'ali yobetetsa Undewa we Imulungu. Hata ka tsakakala yumwe mne iwakulu we libalatsa lya Wayahudi, ng'atoghole bae chawatendile weyaghe. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Imunu ayo kaghenda kwa Pilato, kalomba lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kaluhulumsa, kalupfatsa sanda, kalwika mne likabuli ilisongolighwe mbambalawe, nalyo ng'ana litsikighwe imunu bae. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Tsaikala Ijumaa, litsuwa lya ukwiyandaa, na litsuwa lya Sabato tsalyahabehi kwandusa. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Na awala iwapinga iwatsile na Yesu kulawa Galilaya wamuwinza Yosefu na walyona likabuli na lukuli lwa Yesu halwikighwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kuya woya akaye watanda ghamafuta ighonung'ila ghoya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Mne litsuwa lya Sabato wabwihila ka pfailaghitsighwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsilihuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />12 Litsuwa lya Jumapili lupfilipfili, iwapinga wasola ghamanukato ighawatandile na waghenda kune likabuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Walifika libwe lya kughubikila likabuli libingilisighwa hambalimbali mwe likabuli.<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Libwe lya kughubikila likabuli libingilisighwa hambalimbali mwe likabuli</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Wengila mne likabuli, lekeni ng'awonile bae lukuli lwe IMNDEWA Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Hawang'ali wokangawala kwa chinu acho, bahala iwanu weli iwapfalile ghamaghwanda ghang'alile ng'ani wema habehi nawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wapinga wala wapfuka ng'ani na kwinamila hasi. Baho iwanu wala wawalongela, “Ule mumbama imunu mghima mne iwanu iwafile? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Yesu ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka! Mkumbuke chayawalongele hayakalile mne isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa aghoghighwe ne iwanu wane nzambi, nawo watsomuwamba mna msalaba, na litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Kuya iwapinga wala wakumbuka imbuli haila yawalongele. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Hawoyile kulawa mne likabuli, wawalongela mbuli atso iwanang'ina wala kumi na yumwe wa Yesu ne iwanu wangi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Iwapinga iwalongile mbuli atso kwe iwatumighwa wa Yesu tsawakala Mariya Magidalena, Yoana, na Mariya mai wake Jakobu, ne iwapinga wangi welongotse nawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Lekeni iwatumighwa wa Yesu wayona imbuli ilongighwe ne iwapinga wala yahela mana, apfo ng'awatoghole bae. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Lekeni Petiri kalawa na kutsuma mbaka mne likabuli. Hayafikile, kenama na kusungulila mghati, baho kayona isanda iliyeka. Kuya koya ukaye aku kakangawala kwa aghala ighalawile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kelangusa kwe iwanang'ina weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Malk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mne litsuwa lilila, iwanu weli iwamwinzile Yesu wakala woghenda mne ichitobogha ichikemighwe Emau, utali wa maili saba kulawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Wakala welongetsa wao kwa wao kwa aghala ghose ighalawile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Baho hawakalile welongetsa na kwighutsa, Yesu imwenyegho kalawila na kelongotsa nawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Wamwona, lekeni ng'awammanyile bae. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Kawaghutsa, “Mwoghenda mwelongetsa choni?” Nawo wema na wanyamala, pfihanga pfawo pfonesa usungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Imunu yumwe mne iwanu awo, yakemighwe Kileopa, kamwidika, “Pfii, ghweghwe kwa mhenza uliyeka mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ng'una umanye bae ipfinu pfilawile ako mne ghamatsuwa agha?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Kawaghutsa, “Ipfinu pfachi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Nawo wedika, “Ipfinu ipfimlawile Yesu wa Natsareti. Imunu ayo kakala nabii iyodaha kutenda na kulangulitsa hambele he Imulungu ne iwanu wose. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwakulu wetu tsawamghala kwe iwakulu wa Chirumi yahighighwe ukufa, nawo wamuwamba mna msalaba; <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />tsatulolela yeye iyo iyatsowakombola Waisiraeli. Lekeni leloli litsuwa lya kadatu kulawa ipfilawile ipfinu apfo. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Pfipfila, iwapinga wangi kulawa mne kingili lyetu tsawatutenda tukangawale. Lupfilipfili tsawaghenda mne likabuli, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />lekeni ng'awalufikile bae lukuli lwake. Woya na kutulongela walawilighwa ne wamalaika iwawalongele Yesu kakala mghima. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Kuya iwanu wamwenga iwalongotsagha na twetwe tsawaghenda mne likabuli, nawo wapfika ka iwapinga pfawalongile, ng'awamwonile bae.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mbona, mwawabotsi pfino! Na imimoyo yenu mikomu kutoghola ghose ighalongighwe ne manabii! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Pfii, ng'aibamighwe bae Kiristu kudununzika apfi, na hambele kwingila mne utunitso wake?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Kuya kawalongela ghoya ipfinu pfose ipfimlangusa yeye imwenyegho mne Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka, kwandusila mne ipfitabu ipfiandikighwe na Musa na kughendelela mne ipfitabu pfe manabii wose.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Baho hawatsifikile tsikaye tsiwang'alii wotsighendela, Yesu katenda ka kolumbilila. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Lekeni wamlomba ghendo, “Ukale na twetwe, kwaapfila litsuwa liswa, na chilo chakwingila.” Apfo kaghenda, kakala nawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Hayakalile hasi na kuja ichijo hamwe nawo, kasola chighate, kalonga mighede kwe Imulungu, kachibena, kaweng'a. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Bahala, tsinenge tsawo tsipfumbuka nawo wammanya, naye kagha mnenge mwawo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Tsaweghutsa, “Apfi imimoyo yetu ng'aili yakwaka bae hayakalile kotulongela mnzila na kutulongela ghoya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Bahala woka na kuya Yerusalemu. Wawafika iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe wa Yesu, ne iwanu wangi iwakalile, nawo wetingana hamwe <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />wolonga, “IMNDEWA katsilihuka ghendo! Kamlawila Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Kuya iwanu wala weli wawalongela achila ichiwalawile mnzila, na pfawamtangile Yesu hayachimeghile chighate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ghama 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Hawang'ali wowalongela apfo, Yesu imwenyegho kema hamwe nawo, kawalongela, “Mkale tseghamba!” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Weduka na kupfuka, wapfikitsa waghwona ghumtsimu! <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Lekeni kawalongela, “Mbona mwoghaya? Ebali mwoghanzika mne imimoyo yenu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mlole ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghangu na mmanye nene namwenyegho! Mnikinde mwone; kwaapfila ghumtsimu ghwahela lukuli ne imipate ka pfimmbona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Hayakalile kolonga apfo, kawalangusa ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Hawang'ali ng'awodaha bae kutoghola kwa kudeng'elela na kukangawala ng'ani, Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna ichijo chochose hano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Wamwing'a chihindi cha isomba yokighwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Kachisola, kachija wose womlolesa.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Kuya kawalongela, “Aghano ghagho malonga ghangu ghaniwalongele, ahala hanikalile hamwe na namwe. Tsaibamighwa ghatendeke aghala ghose ghanyandikighwe nene mne Ghamalaghitso gha Musa na mne ipfitabu pfa manabii na Tsaburi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Kuya katsimwemwesela tsimbutsi tsawo wadahe kughamanya Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Kawalongela, “Yandikighwa apfi, Kiristu katsodununzika na litsuwa lya kadatu katsotsilihuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Iwanu wose watsopetelighwa kwa taghwa lyake watsileke nzambi tsawo, naye Imulungu katsowaleghusila nzambi tsawo, kwandusila Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Namwe mwawakalangama we ipfinu pfino. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na nene imwenyegho nitsowaghalila ayula Aba wangu yalongile katsomtuma. Lekeni mwemwe mbete mne bululu mbaka mtsokwing'ighwa ila ingupfu kulawa uchanya.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuya kulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ghama 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Kuya kawalongotsa kunze mwe ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mbaka Betaniya, naye kenula uchanya ghamoko ghake, kawabaliki. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Hayang'ali yowabaliki, kawaleka, kasolighwa kughenda kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Nawo wamtowela ghamaghoti, kuya woya Yerusalemu kuno wodeng'elela <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Waghendelela kukala hane Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kumtunya Imulungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>